<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Luka ya mumkumbo wa vitabu vine va lagano da sambi, vitabu avo volagusa vija Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi. Kila kitabu acho chokemigwa, “Injili,” fambulo jake Mbuli Inogile. Vitabu avo vandikigwa ako kumwande na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana kipindi Yesu viyafile na kuzilibuka. Luka handike mbuli za Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi ziiyeka, lakini vivija kandika mbuli ziwatendile wanahina zake ako kumwande Yesu viyafile na kuzilibuka na kitabu acho kikemigwa Sang'hano za Iwatumigwa. Kuduhu munhu yojuwa kipindi gani hebu chandikiligwa kwahi kitabu kino cha Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Luka, lakini wanhu oifunza mbuli wose oitogolela kamba sengine chandikigwa behi ya mwaka wa 70 toka kuvumbuka kwa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwandikaji kakala Luka yakalile mganga. Wandikaji wake na ulonzi uyekile volagusa kamba heyo kakala munhu yasomile. Luka kalonda kwandika mbuli imoja imoja kamba vizilawilile kwa Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi, kasimulila zimbuli kamba vizilawilile, ili wanhu wayagwe wamwede kwa kusoma mbuli azo (Sula ya 1:1-3). Heyo hakalile Muyahudi bule (Wakolosai 4:10-14) na kandika vija wanhu haweli Wayahudi wahahile kuvijuwa. Mbuli ino yokoneka kwa vija viyafambule mila za Kiyahudi (Sula ya 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Luka iigala ng'hani na vitabu va Matayo na Maluko, kwavija vose vosimulila mbuli zizija mna inzila imoja. Mna ivitabu vose vidatu, Luka yaiyeka kasimulila ng'hani mbuli ya kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Mbatizaji. Vivija Luka kogangamiza ng'hani mbuli za kugela kumgongo (Sula za 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na kumpula Imulungu (Sula za 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Mna isula ya 1:1-4, Luka koitambula Mbuli Inogile iyandike na kosimulila habali kayandika.</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho kosimulila kuvumbuka kwa Yesu na vivija viyaitandile kwa kusang'hana (Sula ya 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">Hanhu hakulu ha Mbuli Inogile (Sula ya 4:14-21:38), Luka kosimulila sang'hano iyatendile Yesu, ng'hani ng'hani unzonza uyatendile na mbuli ziyafundize.</para>
  <para style="io">Kukimambukizo, sula za kabili za kimambukizo (Sula ya 22-24), kasimulila vija Yesu viyafile, viyazikigwe na viyazilibuke.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Mkulu Teofili,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Wanhu wengi wawamba ng'hani kwandika mbuli zija zilawilile kumwetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Wandika mbuli zija zitulongeligwe na wanhu waja wazonile kwa meso gao kusongela kuna ichanduso na wapetile uusenga. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Avo go mkulu, kwavija nizizahila vinogile mbuli zino kulawa kuna ichanduso, vinikona niye yokuwa vinoga kukwandikila goya mbuli zija zilawilile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Notenda vino ili ujuwe ukweli wose wa mbuli ziufundizigwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Mbatizaji kopetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Kipindi acho Helode viyakalile mndewa wa Yudea, kukala na mulava nhosa, twaga jake Zakalia, wa kibumbila cha Abiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abiya. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Walava nhosa waigola mna ivibumbila malongo mabili na nne, na Abiya kakala kilongozi mna ikibumbila cha nane.</char></note> Mwehe wake kakala Elizabeti, nayo vivija kalawa mulukolo lwa mulava nhosa Haluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Wose wabili wakala otenda ganogile mgameso ga Imulungu, na kugagoga Malagizo gose ga Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Wakala wabule wana kwavija Elizabeti kakala mgumba, na wose wabili wakala wavele.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Siku dimoja Zakalia kakala Mng'anda ya Imulungu yosang'hana isang'hano yake ya kulava nhosa, kamba viyatendaga mna izamu yake. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Zakalia kasaguligwa kwa kubwanha simbi, kamba viwatendaga walava nhosa, kwingila Mng'anda ya Mndewa yasome ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Kipindi cha kusoma ubani vikivikile, wanhu wengi wakala kunze ompula Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamulawilila Zakalia, kema mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa upango wa kusomela ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakalia viyamone, kasinhuka na kagwaya kwa bwembwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Lakini msenga wa kuulanga kamulongela, “Sikuudumbe, Zakalia! Imulungu kahulika kupula kwako. Mwehe wako Elizabeti kokulelela mwana wa kimbigalo, twaga jake komkema Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Kodeng'helela ng'hani na wanhu wengi odeng'helela kwa kuvumbuka kwake. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Kokuwa munhu mkulu mgameso ga Mndewa. Honda yang'we ugimbi hebu divai. Kokuwa na Loho Yang'alile kusongela mna iinda ya mamake. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Kowatenda wanhu wengi wa Izilaeli wailumbe na Mndewa Imulungu wao. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Nayo komulongolela Mndewa, kokuwa na nguvu kamba mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Eliya. Kowatenda tata na wana wainogele, kowagalusa wanhu waja hawamtegeleza Imulungu wagese ganogile kamba wanhu wanogile, avo yamtandile Mndewa wanhu zake.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakalia kamuuza msenga ija wa kuulanga, “Vino nojuwaze mbuli ino kamba ya ukweli? Niye na mwehe wangu twa wavele.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Msenga ija kamwidika, “Niye na Gabilieli. Nokwima haulongozi ha Imulungu, heyo ayo yanhumile nonge na gweye kukupetela mbuli ino inogile. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Lakini kwavija hutogole mbuli zangu zonda zilawilile mna ikipindi chake, sambi hudaha kulonga mbaka siku vonda ilawilile mbuli ino.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Kipindi acho wanhu wakalile ombeta Zakalia, wakanganya habali kokawa kulawa Mng'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Viyalawile kunze hadahile kulonga nao. Wajuwa hana kinhu cha unzonza kiyaonile Mng'anda ya Imulungu, kwavija kawagwaa kilaguso kwa kwinula makono gake, na kakala halonga.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Viyamambukize sang'hano yake Mng'anda ya Imulungu, kabwela ukae. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Hamwande kidogo imwehe Elizabeti kagoga inda. Hasegele ukae kumwake kwa miyezi mitano. Kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>“Hakimambukizo Mndewa kanisegesela kinyala mgameso ga wanhu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu kopetigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elizabeti viyakalile na inda ya miyezi sita, Imulungu kamtuma msenga wa kuulanga, twaga jake Gabilieli, yachole kudibuga da Nazaleti, mwiisi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Kakala na usenga wa mhambe imoja yafungiligwe zengele na mbigalo imoja twaga jake Yusufu, yalawile mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi. Mhambe ayo twaga jake Malia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Msenga ija kamcholela Malia, kamulongela, “Zihoze! Mndewa kahamoja na gweye. Nayo kakunogela ng'hani!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Malia viyauhulike usenga awo wa msenga wa kuulanga, kakala na mfundo ng'hani muumoyo wake, kakanganya usenga awo ofambula choni. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Msenga ija kamulongela, “Malia, sikuudumbe, gweye kupata ng'hekewa ya Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Kogoga inda na kolela mwana wa kimbigalo, nayo komkema Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Kokuwa munhu mkulu, kokemigwa Mwana wa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani. Mndewa Imulungu komgwaa kigoda cha undewa, kamba viyakalile Daudi muhenga wake. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Kokuwa mtawala wa lukolo lwa Yakobo milele, na undewa wake hawisha bule!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Malia kamuuza msenga ija, “Niye na mhambe. Lelo mbuli ayo yokuwaze?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Msenga ija kamwidika, “Loho Yang'alile kokwizila, na nguvu za Imulungu zokugubika. Avo Mwana yonda yavumbuke kokuwa Yang'alile na kokemigwa Mwana wa Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Kumbuka ndugu yako Elizabeti. Wanhu wakala olonga kakala mgumba, lakini sambi kana inda ya miyezi sita, hamoja na uvele uyalinao. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Kwavija kuduhu kinhu kimulemela Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Malia kalonga, “Niye na msang'hanaji wa Mndewa, nailawilile kumwangu kamba viulongile.” Abaho msenga ija kasegela.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malia komtembelela Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Kumwande kidogo Malia kafunga mwanza, kalopola kuchola kuna idibuga dili mvigongo va isi ya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Kengila mng'anda ya Zakalia, kamulamusa Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elizabeti viyahulike Malia komulamusa, king'hele kili mna iinda yake kizumha. Nayo Elizabeti kamemezigwa Loho Yang'alile, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>kalonga kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Gweye kunogeligwa kubanza watwanzi wose, na imwana yonda umulele konogeligwa! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Habali mbuli ino ng'hulu inilawilile niye, mbaka mama wa Mndewa wangu keza kunhembelela? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Vimhulike kondamusa, mwana king'hele yeli mna iinda yangu kazumha kwa kudeng'helela. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Kumweda gweye utogola usenga wa Mndewa, kwavija olawilila kumwako!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lwila lwa Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Malia kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Moyo wangu omgwaa nhogolwa Mndewa,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Loho yangu yomdeng'helela kwavija Imulungu Mkombola wangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>kang'humbuka, niye msang'hanaji wake muhole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kulawa sambi wanhu wose ong'hema munhu yamwedile,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>kwavija Imulungu Mkulu kanhendela vinhu vikulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Twaga jake ding'ala.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Kulawa lukolo na lukolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">kowonela bazi wanhu wose omtegeleza.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Katenda mbuli ng'hulu kwa mkono wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Kawapwililisa wanhu weli na magoda mmizoyo yao.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Kawahumulusa wandewa mna ivigoda vao va undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">na kawenula wahole.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Weli na nzala kawatenda wegute kwa vinhu vinogile na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">kawawinga matajili makono gaiyeka.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Kasang'hana kija kiyalongile kwa wahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">keza kumtaza msang'hanaji wake Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Kakumbuka kumonela bazi Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">na lukolo lwake lose siku zose!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Malia kakala kwa Elizabeti miyezi midatu, abaho kabwela ukae kumwake.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Kipindi cha kuifungula Elizabeti vikivikile, kaifungula mwana wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Wanhu weli behi nayo na ndugu zake viwahulike mbuli ng'hulu ziyatendeligwe na Mndewa, wadeng'helela hamoja nayo.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Imwana viyavikize siku nane, wamwingiza kumbi. Walonda kumkema Zakalia, twaga da tatake, <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>lakini mamake kalonga, “Bule, twaga jake Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Wamulongela, “Kuduhu munhu mulukolo lwenu yeli na twaga dijo!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Abaho wamgwaa kilaguso tatake, wamuuza twaga gani diyalondile mwanage yakemigwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakalia kawapula kibao cha kwandikila, kandika vino, “Twaga jake Yohana.” Wanhu wose wakanganya! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Bahaja Zakalia kadaha kulonga, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Wanhu weli behi nayo wadumba ng'hani. Mbuli izo za unzonza zibwililika kila hanhu kuvigongo va isi ya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Kila munhu yahulike mbuli ayo kaigelegeza, kauza, “Vino mwana ino kokuwa nani?” Kwavija udahi wa Mndewa ukala hamoja nayo.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lwila lwa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zakalia tatake Yohana kamemezigwa Loho Yang'alile, kalonga usenga wa Imulungu,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Yatogoligwe Mndewa, Imulungu wa Izilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Keza kuwataza wanhu zake na kuwagombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Katugwaa Mkombola yeli na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">mzukulu wa Daudi msang'hanaji wake.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Kamba viyalongile toka mwaka kubitila watula ndagu zake wang'alile,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>kamba kotukombola na wanhu wang'hobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kulawa mmakono ga wanhu watwihile.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Kalonga kowonela bazi wahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na kokumbuka lagano jake ding'alile.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Kaiduwila kwa muhenga wetu Abulahamu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>kutukombola mmakono ga wanhu watwihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">na kututenda tumsang'hanile bila kudumba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>tuwe wanhu wang'alile na wanhu otenda goyolonda Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">siku zose za ugima wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Gweye mwanangu, kokemigwa mtula ndagu wa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Komulongolela Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">kuitanda nzila yake.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Kowalongela wanhu zake kamba okomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">na nzambi zao zogeligwa kumgongo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Imulungu wetu kana bazi na moyo unogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Kotumwemwesela mulenge wa ukombola kulawa kuulanga,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>na owamwemwesela wanhu wose okala mdiziza da ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na kulongoza magulu getu mnzila ya tindiwalo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Imwana ija kagendelela kukula lukuli na kawa na nguvu mwiiloho. Kakala kuluwala mbaka siku dija viyalawilile mgameso ga wanhu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Kipindi acho, Agusito, Mndewa wa Lumi, kalagiza wanhu wose mwiisi ya Lumi wapetigwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Awo ukala mwanza wa ichanduso wa wanhu kupetigwa kipindi Kilenio viyakalile mkulu wa isi ya Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Avo kila munhu kachola kudibuga diyavumbuke kwandikigwa twaga jake.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yusufu kasegela kudibuga da Nazaleti mwiisi ya Galilaya, kachola kudibuga da Beselehemu mwiisi ya Yudea, hanhu hayavumbuke mndewa Daudi. Yusufu kachola kuko kwavija kolawa mulukolo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Kachola na Malia kupetigwa, yakalile yamfungile zengele. Nayo Malia kakala na inda. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Viwakalile kudibuga da Beselehemu, kipindi cha Malia kuifungula kivika. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Kaifungula mwanage wa chaudele wa kimbigalo, kamvaza vikumbi. Abaho kamtambaliza hanhu hoodimiligwa ng'ombe, kwavija hawapatile gati mzing'anda za wageni.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wasusilaji wa ng'hondolo na wasenga wa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Kilo acho kukala na wasusilaji wa ng'hondolo mna imigunda ili behi na Beselehemu, wakala okaliza fugo zao.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Wasusilaji okaliza fugo zao</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Msenga wa kuulanga kawalawilila, ukulu wa Mndewa uwamwemwesela, nao wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Lakini msenga ija kawalongela, “Sikumudumbe! Niye niwagalila mbuli inogile, mbuli yonda itende wanhu wose wadeng'helele. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Lelo kudibuga da Daudi, Mkombola wenu kavumbuka, ayo Kilisito Mndewa! <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Kino acho kilaguso kumwenu, momvika mwana king'hele kavazigwa vikumbi, katambalizigwa hanhu hoodimiligwa ng'ombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Bahaja bumbila kulu da wasenga wa kuulanga dilawilila, diilumba na msenga ija iyagwe, wamtogola Imulungu walonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Ukulu kwa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na tindiwalo diwe kwa wanhu wa mwiisi yawanogele!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Wasenga wa kuulanga viwabwelile kuulanga, wasusilaji wailongela, “Tucholeni Beselehemu tukailole mbuli ino ilawilile, yailongile Mndewa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Avo walopola kuchola, wawavika Malia na Yusufu, na wamona imwana king'hele katambalizigwa hanhu hoodimiligwa ng'ombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Wasusilaji viwamone imwana, wawalongela kija kiyawalongele msenga wa kuulanga mbuli ya imwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Wanhu wose wahulike kija kiwalongile wasusilaji, wakanganya. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Lakini Malia kazika mbuli izo muumoyo na kazigelegeza ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Wasusilaji wabwela kuno okwimba nyila za kumtogola Imulungu kwa mbuli zose ziwahulike na kuzona. Zose zilawilila kamba msenga wa kuulanga viyawalongele.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogweleligwa twaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Mna isiku ya nane, siku ya kwingizigwa imwana kumbi, wamgwaa twaga da Yesu. Twaga ijo kagweleligwa na msenga wa kuulanga mamake hanagoga inda.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa Mng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Vikivikile kipindi cha kuisunha kamba Musa viyalagize mna Gamalagizo gake, Yusufu na Malia wamsola imwana na wachola nayo Yelusalemu ili wamwike mgameso ga Mndewa, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>kamba viyandikigwe mna Gamalagizo ga Mndewa, “Kila mwana wa chaudele wa kimbigalo yonda yavumbuke yagaligwe mgameso ga Mndewa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Vivija wachola kulava nhosa kamba malagizo ga Mndewa vigalondile, “Huwa wabili hebu makinda mabili ga njiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Kipindi acho kukala na munhu yokala Yelusalemu, twaga jake Simeoni. Munhu ayo kakala yotenda goyolonda Imulungu na komdumba Imulungu. Vivija kakala yobetela ukombola wa Izilaeli, na Loho Yang'alile kakala hamoja nayo. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Nayo Loho Yang'alile kamulongela honda yafe mbaka yamone Kilisito Mkombola. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Loho kamulongoza Simeoni yachole kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu. Abaho Yusufu na Malia wamgala imwana Yesu kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu wamtendele kamba Malagizo ga Musa vigalondile. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeoni kamsola imwana mmakono gake, kamtogola Imulungu, kalonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Mndewa, sambi kusang'hana kamba viulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">muleke msang'hanaji wako yachole moyo uholile.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Kwa meso gangu niwona ukombola wako,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>ukombola uutandile mgameso ga wanhu wose.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Mulenge uwatenda wanhu haweli Wayahudi wajuwe goulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na kugala ukulu kwa wanhu zako wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Tatake na mamake imwana wakanganya kija kiyalongile Simeoni mbuli ya imwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simeoni kawatambikila, kamulongela Malia, “Mwana ino kasaguligwa na Imulungu mbuli ya kupotela na kukomboligwa wanhu wengi wa Izilaeli. Nayo kokuwa kilaguso kulawa kwa Imulungu, na wanhu wengi omulema. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Abaho magesa ga wanhu wengi gogubuligwa. Na gweye mwenyego, usungu uli kamba panga dikutwa dousoma moyo wako.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Kukala na mgane imoja mtula ndagu wa Imulungu, yakalile mvele ng'hani, twaga jake Ana, biti Fanueli kulawa kabila da Asheli. Mtwanzi ayo kakala na mkasano wake kwa miyaka saba toka yasoligwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Nayo kakala mgane mbaka viyavikize miyaka malongo manane na nne. Kipindi chose acho kakala Mng'anda ya Imulungu imisi na ikilo, komgwaa ukulu Imulungu, kopula na kofunga kuja. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Saa iija kavika, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu na kalonga mbuli za imwana kwa wanhu wose wakalile ombeta Imulungu yaikombole Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yusufu na Malia viwamambukize kugatenda gaja gose galondeke na Malagizo ga Mndewa, wabwela kudibuga jao da Nazaleti mwiisi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Imwana kakula na kawa mbala goya, kakala yamemile nzewele, na ng'hekewa ya Imulungu ikala kumwake.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga Yesu Mng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kila mwaka tatake na mamake Yesu wacholaga Yelusalemu kuna inyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesu viyavikize miyaka longo na mibili, wachola kuna inyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka kamba viwatendaga. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Nyimwilinyimwili viimalile, wabwela ukae, lakini mbwanga Yesu kasigala Yelusalemu. Tatake na mamake hawajuwile bule. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Wao viwagize kakala mna ikibumbila cha wanhu, avo watembela siku ngima. Abaho wasonga kumzahila Yesu mwa ndugu zao na mbwiga zao. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Hawamone bule, avo wabweleganya Yelusalemu kumzahila. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Siku ya kadatu wamvika kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, kakala hamoja na wafundiza wa Kiyahudi, kowategeleza na kuwauza. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Wanhu wose wamuhulike wakanganya nzewele zake na vija viyawedike. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Tatake na mamake viwamone wasinhuka ng'hani. Mamake kamuuza, “Mwanangu, habali ututendile vino? Niye na tatako tukala moyo nyunguwaa tokuzahila gweye!”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesu kawedika, “Habali munizahila? Vino hamujuwile bule niye nilondigwa ng'hale mng'anda ya Tatangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Lakini wao hawajuwile fambulo da ulonzi awo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Abaho Yesu kachola nao Nazaleti, ako kakala kowategeleza. Mamake kazika muumoyo mbuli zino zose. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesu kakula lukuli na ubala, kanogeligwa na Imulungu hamoja na wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizaji kowapetela wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mwaka wa longo na tano muundewa wa mndewa wa Lumi yakemigwe Tibelio, Pontio Pilato kakala mkulu wa isi ya Yudea, na Helode kakala mkulu wa isi ya Galilaya, na Filipo mdodo wake kakala mkulu wa Itulea na isi ya Tulakoniti, na Lusania kakala mkulu wa isi ya Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Anasi na Kayafa wakala wakulu wa walava nhosa. Kipindi acho mbuli ya Imulungu imwizila Yohana mwanage Zakalia ako kuluwala <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yohana kachola mziisi zose zili mmabehi na lwanda lwa Yolidani, kawapetela wanhu, “Lekeni nzambi na mbatizigwe na Imulungu kozigela kumgongo nzambi zenu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Kamba viyandikigwe mna ikitabu cha mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Munhu kokema kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Itandeni nzila ya Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">goloseni nzila yonda yabite!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Kila konde dimemezigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">kila kisugulu na kigongo visegesigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">nzila hazigoloke zigolosigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">na nzila zihile zotendigwa goya.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Wanhu wose okona Imulungu kowakombola wanhu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lumcholela Yohana yawabatize. Yohana kawalongela, “Mweye mizoka! Nani yawalongele modaha kuikimbila nhaguso yonda igaligwe na Imulungu? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Musang'hane gaja gonda galaguse muzileka nzambi zenu. Sikumuilongele, ‘Abulahamu ayo muhenga wetu.’ Nowalongela, Imulungu kodaha kugasola mabwe gano na kugatenda lukolo lwa Abulahamu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Shoka ikigwa goya kukanha mibiki mna gamasina. Kila biki hadilela matunda ganogile dokanhigwa na kwasigwa muumoto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lumuuza Yohana, “Avo tutende choni?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yohana kawedika, “Munhu yoyose yeli na viwalo vibili yamgwee kimoja miyage yelibule, na ija yeli na ndiya yatende vivo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Wabokela kodi nao weza kubatizigwa. Wamuuza Yohana, “Mfundiza, siye tutende choni?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Nayo kawalongela, “Sikumubokele kodi kubanza vija vimulagizigwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Wakalizi nao wamuuza, “Na siye tutende choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Nayo kawalongela, “Sikumumboke munhu yoyose sente yake hebu sikumumtaguse munhu yoyose kwa uvizi. Mutosheke na kija kimubokela.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Wanhu wakala obetela kwiza kwa Mkombola, avo wasonga kuiuza mmizoyo yao kamba Yohana kodaha kuwa ayo Kilisito Mkombola. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yohana kawalongela wose, “Niye nowabatiza mweye kwa mazi, lakini kokwiza ija yeli munhu mkulu ng'hani kubanza niye. Niye sifaya hata kudohola nzabi za vilatu vake. Ayo kowabatiza kwa Loho Yang'alile na moto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Ayo kana lungo mmakono gake lwa kubetela uhule wake. Kowika uhemba kukanho, lakini koisoma imikumvi muumoto haufaga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Kwa mbuli nyingi Yohana kawapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile na kawalonda waleke nzambi zao. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Lakini Yohana kamkomhokela mndewa Helode, mkulu wa isi ya Galilaya kwavija kamsola Helodiya, mwehe wa mdodo wake, na katenda nzambi nyingi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Abaho Helode katenda dihile ng'hani kwa kumgodeka Yohana mkifungo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobatizigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Wanhu wose viwakalile obatizigwa, Yesu nayo kabatizigwa. Viyakalile kompula Imulungu, ulanga ugubuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>na Loho Yang'alile kamuhulumukila mna ulukuli luigalile na huwa. Sauti ihulikigwa kulawa kuulanga, “Gweye kwa Mwanangu nikunogele. Ninogelwa na gweye.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa lukolo luyavumbuke Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu viyasongile sang'hano yake, kakala na miyaka malongo madatu. Avo wanhu wagesa kakala mwanage Yusufu, mwanage Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>mwanage Matati, mwanage Lawi, mwanage Meliki, mwanage Yani, mwanage Yusufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>mwanage Matatia, mwanage Amosi, mwanage Nahumu, mwanage Esili, mwanage Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>mwanage Maati, mwanage Matatia, mwanage Semeni, mwanage Yusufu, mwanage Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>mwanage Yoana, mwanage Lesa, mwanage Zelubabeli, mwanage Shealitieli, mwanage Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>mwanage Meliki, mwanage Adi, mwanage Kosamu, mwanage Elimadamu, mwanage Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>mwanage Yoshua, mwanage Eliezeli, mwanage Yolimu, mwanage Matati, mwanage Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>mwanage Simeoni, mwanage Yuda, mwanage Yusufu, mwanage Yonamu, mwanage Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>mwanage Melea, mwanage Mena, mwanage Matata, mwanage Natani, mwanage Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>mwanage Yese, mwanage Obedi, mwanage Boazi, mwanage Salimoni, mwanage Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>mwanage Aminadabu, mwanage Adimini, mwanage Alini, mwanage Heziloni, mwanage Pelesi, mwanage Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>mwanage Yakobo, mwanage Isaka, mwanage Abulahamu, mwanage Tela, mwanage Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>mwanage Selugi, mwanage Lagau, mwanage Pelegi, mwanage Ebeli, mwanage Sela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>mwanage Kenani, mwanage Alifakisadi, mwanage Shemu, mwanage Nuhu, mwanage Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>mwanage Metusela, mwanage Henoko, mwanage Yaledi, mwanage Mahalaleli, mwanage Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>mwanage Enoshi, mwanage Seti, mwanage Adamu, mwanage Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu kabwela kulawa Yolidani, kamema Loho Yang'alile na kalongozigwa na Loho Yang'alile mbaka kuluwala. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Ako kagezigwa na Mwenembago kwa ikipindi cha siku malongo mane. Mna ikipindi chose acho hadile kinhu chochose, avo vizimalile siku azo, nzala imuluma.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamulongela Yesu, “Kamba gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu, dilongele dibwe dino digaluke gate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Munhu hawa mgima kwa kuja kwiiyeka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka uchanha ng'hani, kamulagusila undewa wose wa mwiisi kwa mwanza umoja. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Mwenembago kamulongela Yesu, “Nokugwaa ukulu na utajili wose uno, kwavija vose va mmakono gangu, na niye nodaha kumgwaa munhu yoyose inimulonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Nokugwaa vinhu vose vino, kamba wahanitambikila.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Maandiko Gang'alile golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:8">‘Mtambikile Mndewa Imulungu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:8">na umsang'hanile heyo yaiyeka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka Yelusalemu, kamwika uchanha ng'hani kuna ikiswili cha ing'anda ya Imulungu, abaho kamulongela Yesu, “Kamba gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu, ilagaze mwenyego hasi kulawa hano. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Imulungu kowalagiza wasenga zake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:10">wa kuulanga wakukalize!’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Na vivija golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:11">‘Okupapa mmakono gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:11">sikuuilumize magulu gako mgamabwe!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Sikuumgeze Mndewa Imulungu wako!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Mwenembago viyamambukize kumgeza Yesu kwa kila nzila, kamuleka mbaka kipindi kiyagwe kinogile.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosonga sang'hano yake ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Abaho Yesu kabwela isi ya Galilaya, nguvu ya Loho Yang'alile ikala hamoja nayo. Mbuli zake zibwililika mziisi zose za mmabehi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Kakala yofundiza mna zing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na kila munhu kamgwaa nhogolwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemigwa ako Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Abaho Yesu kachola Nazaleti, hanhu kuyakulile. Mna isiku ya Kubwihila, kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu kamba viyatendaga. Kema yasome Maandiko Gang'alile. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Kagweleligwa kitabu cha mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya, kakifungula na kona hanhu handikigwe,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Loho wa Mndewa Imulungu kamgati mmwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kwavija kanisagula niwagalile wanhu wakiwa Mbuli Inogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Kanituma niwapetele wagodekigwe kamba olekesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na waja wasuwameso walole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na kuwakombola waja wadununzigwe,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>na kuwalongela kamba saa ivika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">ya Mndewa kuwakombola wanhu zake.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Abaho Yesu kakigubika ikitabu, kakibweza kwa msang'hanaji, abaho kakala hasi. Wanhu wose wakalile mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu wamulola Yesu bunhuu. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Nayo kasonga kuwalongela, “Chandikigwe muno, lelo kilawilila kamba vimuhulike.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Wose wamtogola na wakanganya mbuli zake zinogile ziyalongile. Walonga, “Vino ino siyo mwanage Yusufu?.”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nojuwa monongela ulonzi uno, ‘Mganga, ihonye mwenyego! Gose gatuhulike kugatenda ako Kapelinaumu, vivija gatende na hano ukae kumwako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ukweli, kuduhu mtula ndagu yotegelezigwa ukae kumwake.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>“Nhegelezeni, ona kukala na wagane wengi mwiisi ya Izilaeli mna ikipindi cha Eliya. Kipindi acho, mvula haitowile miyaka midatu na nusu, kukala na lufilili lwa nzala mwiisi yose. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Lakini Eliya hatumigwe bule kwa munhu yoyose iyagwe mwiisi ya Izilaeli, ila kwa mgane imoja yakalile Selepata, mwiisi ya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Vivija mna ikipindi cha mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Elisha, kukala na wanhu wengi wakalile olumwa utamu wa dikulu mwiisi ya Izilaeli. Lakini kuduhu munhu yoyose iyagwe yahonyigwe, ila Naamani yaiyeka, munhu wa isi ya Siliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Wanhu wakalile mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu wagevuzika ng'hani viwahulike avo. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Wenuka, wamulava kunze kudibuga jao dizengigwe uchanha kukigongo, wamgala mbaka mwiingema ya kigongo acho, walonda kumpigisa hasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Lakini Yesu kabita hagati ya lunhu luja, kalawanya.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yeli na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maluko 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Abaho Yesu kachola kudibuga da Kapelinaumu mwiisi ya Galilaya. Mwiisiku ya Kubwihila, kakala yofundiza wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Mafundizo gake gawakanganya wanhu wose, kwavija kakala kolonga kwa udahi. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu kukala na munhu yeli na kinyamkela. Kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Oii! Kolonda kututenda choni, Yesu wa Nazaleti? Vino kwiza kutukoma? Nokujuwa, Gweye kwa ija Yang'alile wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu kamkomhokela ikinyamkela ija, “Nyamala! Mulawe munhu ino!” Kinyamkela kambwanha hasi munhu ija mgameso gao, abaho kamulawa bila kumulumiza.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani na wailongela, “Mbuli gani zino? Munhu ino kana nguvu na udahi wa kuwakomhokela vinyamkela, nao omtegeleza!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Avo mbuli za Yesu zibwililika kila hanhu mwiisi ija.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesu kalawa kuna ing'anda ya kumpula Imulungu, kachola ukae kumwake Simoni. Mkwe wa kitwanzi wa Simoni kakala yolumwa homa ng'hali, avo wamulongela Yesu yamuhonye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yesu kamcholela, kema behi na lusazi lwa mtwanzi ayo, kaikomhokela homa imulawe. Homa imulawa, bahaja mtwanzi ija kenuka, kasonga kuwasang'hanila.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Zuwa vidihongile, wanhu wose wakalile na watamu wawagala kwa Yesu, nayo keka makono gake uchanha mwa kila munhu na kuwahonya wose. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Vinyamkela wawalawa wanhu wengi na kuguta, “Gweye kwa mwana wa Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Yesu kawakomhokela na kawagomesa kulonga, kwavija wamjuwa kamba kakala Kilisito.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela wanhu mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maluko 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Imitondo yake, Yesu kasegela kudibuga, kachola hanhu kuduhu wanhu. Wanhu wasonga kumzahila, na viwamone, walonda kumgomesa sikuyachole. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Vivija nolondigwa kuwapetela wanhu wa mmabuga gayagwe Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Imulungu, kwavija acho kiyanhumile Imulungu kukisang'hana.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Avo kawapetela wanhu mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu mwiisi yose ya Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wanahina wa ichanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala yemile mumgwazo wa lamba da Genesaleti. Wanhu wengi wakala oisung'ha sung'ha wategeleze mbuli ya Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Yesu kazona ngalawa mbili zikalile mwiingema ya lamba, zilekigwe na wavula somba, wakalile osunha mizavu yao. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu kengila mwiingalawa imoja ikalile ya Simoni, kamulonda Simoni yaikwese mgamazi. Abaho Yesu kakala mwiingalawa, kafundiza lunhu luja.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Viyamambukize kufundiza, kamulongela Simoni, “Kwesa ingalawa mbaka kuna gamazi mengi, abaho gweye na wayago mupigise mizavu yenu muvule somba.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoni kamwidika, “Go mkulu, tusang'hana ng'hani kilo kigima lakini hatupatile kinhu bule. Lakini kamba gweye kolonga avo, nogela mizavu yangu mgamazi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Wapigisa mizavu yao, somba wengi wanamata mbaka mizavu yao ilonda kudegeka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Avo wawakema wayao wakalile mwiingalawa iyagwe weze kuwataza. Wayao weza na wazimemeza ngalawa zose mbili, zose zikala zimemile somba mbaka zilonda kudidimila. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoni Petulo viyachonile kija kilawilile, kamfugamila Yesu mmagulu, kalonga, “Mndewa, segela haulongozi wangu, niye nimema nzambi!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Simoni na wayage wakanganya ng'hani mbuli ya somba wengi wawapatile. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Vivija wayage Simoni, Yakobo na Yohana, wanage Zebedayo, nao wakanganya. Yesu kamulongela Simoni, “Sikuudumbe. Kulawa sambi kokuwa mvulaji wa wanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Wazilava ngalawa zao kunze mumgwazo, wavileka vinhu vose, wamkweleleza Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yeli na dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yesu viyakalile kudibuga dimoja, kukala na munhu imoja yakalile na utamu wa dikulu. Viyamonile Yesu, kaibwanha hasi, kampula, “Go mkulu, wahalonda, kodaha kunihonya!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu kagolosa mkono wake, kamkwasa. Kalonga, “Nolonda, hona!” Bahaja utamu wa dikulu umulawa munhu ija. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesu kamulagiza, “Sikuumulongele munhu yoyose, lakini goga inzila mbaka kwa mulava nhosa ukailaguse, abaho kalave nhosa kamba viyalagize Musa ili kutenda kila munhu yatogole kamba kuhonyigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Lakini mbuli za Yesu zibwililika kila hanhu. Wanhu wengi weza kumtegeleza na kuhonyigwa mitamu yao. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Lakini Yesu kachola hanhu kuduhu wanhu na kampula Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Siku dimoja Yesu viyakalile kofundiza, Mafalisayo wayagwe na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala aho. Wakala walawile kila buga mwiisi ya Galilaya na Yudea na kulawa Yelusalemu. Nguvu ya Mndewa ikala hamoja na Yesu kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Wanhu wayagwe weza kuno wampapa mulusazi munhu yaholole. Wageza kumwingiza mng'anda wamwike haulongozi wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Lakini hawapatile nzila ya kumwingiza mng'anda, kwavija kukala na lunhu lwa wanhu. Avo wamsola mtamu wao, wamgala uchanha kukiswili, watobola zonzo. Abaho wamuhumulusa na lusazi lwake mbaka hagati ya lunhu lwa wanhu, wamwika haulongozi wa Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Wanhu wane omuhumulusa munhu kukiswili</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesu viyone kutamanila kwao, kamulongela munhu ija, “Mbwigangu, nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wasonga kuiuza, “Munhu gani ino kolonga mbuli za kumuliga Imulungu? Imulungu yaiyeka ayo yodaha kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesu kajuwa viwagesile, avo kawalongela, “Habali mogesa avo? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Choni kibuhile, kulonga, ‘Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo,’ hebu kulonga, ‘Ima utembele’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Lakini nolonda mujuwe kamba Mwana wa Munhu kana udahi mwiisi wa kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu.” Abaho kamulongela munhu ija yaholole, “Nokulongela, ima, papa lusazi lwako, uchole ukae kumwako!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Bahaja munhu ija kenuka mgameso ga wanhu, kapapa lusazi lwake mumo muyatambalale, kachola ukae kumwake kuno komtogola Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani na kudumba! Wamtogola Imulungu walonga, “Lelo tona unzonza!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Abaho Yesu kachola na kamona mbokela kodi yakemigwe Lawi kakala mng'anda ya kusolela kodi. Yesu kamulongela, “Nikweleleze.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lawi kenuka, kaleka kila kinhu, kamkweleleza.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Abaho Lawi kamtendela Yesu nyimwilinyimwili ng'hulu ukae kumwake. Vivija kukala na wabokela kodi wengi na wanhu wayagwe wagonekigwe. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wakalile aho wawauza wanahina wa Yesu, “Habali moja na kung'wa hamoja na wabokela kodi na wanhu otenda nzambi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu kawedika, “Wanhu wagima hawalonda mganga, lakini waja weli watamu omulonda mganga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Sizile kuwakema wanhu ogesa wanoga, lakini niza kuwakema waja wene nzambi waleke.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga kuja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamulongela Yesu, “Wanahina wa Yohana Mbatizaji ofunga kuja miyanza mingi na kumpula Imulungu, na wanahina wa Mafalisayo otenda vivo, lakini wanahina zako oja na kung'wa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino mogesa wanhu wagonekigwe kuna idizengele odaha kufunga kuja kipindi munhu yosola kahamoja nao? Havidahika bule! <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Lakini kipindi chokwiza, munhu yosola vonda yasegesigwe kumwao, baho ofunga kuja.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Kuduhu munhu yokanha kilaka mkiwalo cha sambi na kukika mkiwalo cha umwaka. Yahatenda avo, kokinanga kija kiwalo cha sambi, na kilaka acho honda kiigale na kiwalo cha umwaka. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Vivija kuduhu munhu yogida divai ya sambi mna mifuko ya ng'hwembe ya umwaka. Kwavija yahatenda avo, divai ya sambi yoitula mifuko ayo ya umwaka, divai yokwitika, na mifuko yobanangika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Divai ya sambi yogidigwa mmifuko ya ng'hwembe ya sambi! <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Kuduhu munhu yolonda divai ya sambi yahamambukiza kung'wa ya umwaka. Kwavija kolonga, ‘Ya umwaka inoga ng'hani.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya siku ya Kubwihila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Mna isiku imoja ya Kubwihila, Yesu kakala yobita mmigunda ya uhemba. Wanahina zake wasonga kubena mikungwi ya uhemba, wagafigisa mmakono gao na kuja mhule zake. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wawauza, “Habali motenda kinhu kigomesigwe mna isiku ya Kubwihila?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino mweye hamusomile kija kiyatendile Daudi na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Daudi kengila Mng'anda ya Imulungu, kasola magate galavigwe kwa Imulungu, kagaja na vivija kawagwaa wayage. Malagizo gawagomesa wanhu wayagwe kuja magate gago ila kwa walava nhosa waiyeka.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Abaho Yesu kamambukiza kwa kulonga, “Mwana wa Munhu ayo Mndewa wa siku ya Kubwihila.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaholole mkono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Mna isiku iyagwe ya Kubwihila, Yesu kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu na kafundiza. Baho kukala na munhu imoja, mkono wake wa kudila ukala uholole. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wayagwe wakala ozahila kilamuso cha kumtagusa Yesu, avo wakala omulola wamone kamba komuhonya munhu mwiisiku ya Kubwihila. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Lakini Yesu kawajuwa viwagesile, kamulongela munhu ija yaholole mkono, “Ima wize hano haulongozi.” Munhu ija kenuka na kwima hagati. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela, “Nowauza, vino Malagizo getu gotulonda tutende choni mwiisiku ya Kubwihila? Kutenda ganogile hebu kutenda gehile? Kuhonya ugima wa munhu hebu kuukoma?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Yesu kawalola wanhu wose wakalile aho, abaho kamulongela munhu ija, “Golosa mkono wako.” Munhu ija katenda avo, na mkono wake uhona kabili.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Lakini wanhu wagevuzika ng'hani na wasonga kuilongela wamtende choni Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosagula watumigwa longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Kipindi kija Yesu kachola kuna ikigongo kumpula Imulungu, kakala ako kilo kigima kompula Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Imitondo yake, kawakema wanahina zake, kawasagula longo na wabili mna idibumbila jao, kawagwaa twaga da watumigwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Watumigwa awo wakala Simoni, ayo Yesu kamkema Petulo na Andeleya mdodo wake, Yakobo na Yohana, Filipo na Batulumayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matayo na Tomaso na Yakobo mwanage Alufayo na Simoni yakemigwe Zelote, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yuda mwanage Yakobo na Yuda Isikaliote yamuhinduke Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza na kuhonya wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayo 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu viyahumuluke kukigongo hamoja na watumigwa zake, kema hanhu hagoloke hamoja na wanahina zake wengi. Lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lukala aho kulawa isi yose ya Yudea na buga da Yelusalemu, na kulawa mwhani ya isi za Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Weza kumtegeleza Yesu na kuhonyigwa mitamu yao. Vivija wanhu waja wakalile ogazigwa na vinyamkela weza na wahonyigwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Wanhu wose wageza kumkwasa Yesu, kwavija nguvu ya kuhonya ikala ilawa kumwake na kuwahonya wose.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kudeng'helela na kunyunyuwala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayo 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesu kawalola wanahina zake, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mmweda mweye muli wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwavija Undewa wa Imulungu uli wenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Mmweda mweye muli na nzala sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwavija mokwiguta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mmweda mweye mulila sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwavija modeng'helela!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“Mmweda mweye kamba wanhu omwihilani, owalema, owaliga na kuwalonga vihile kwa mbuli ya Mwana wa Munhu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Deng'heleleni na kucheza vonda galawilile, kwavija mwikiligwa nhunza ng'hulu kuulanga. Kwavija vivo wahenga zao viwawatendele watula ndagu wa Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Lakini mogaya mweye muli matajili sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwavija mmala kupata deng'ho jenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Mogaya mweye mwigute sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwavija mokona nzala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mogaya mweye museka sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwavija moiyalala na kulila!”<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Mogaya mweye kamba wanhu wose owagwaa nhogolwa kwavija wahenga zao vivija wawatendela vivo watula ndagu wa uvizi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwanogela wakwihile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Lakini nowalongela mweye munitegeleza, wanogeleni wamwihileni, muwatendele ganogile waja owatendela gehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Muwatambikile waja owaduwila, na muwapulile kwa Imulungu waja omonelani. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Munhu yonda yakutowe kanza dimoja, muleke yakutowe kanza diyagwe vivija, kamba munhu kokuboka koti jako, muleke yasole na shati jako vivija. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Munhu yahakupula kinhu mgwee, na munhu yokuboka vinhu vako, sikuulonde yakubwezele. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Avo watendeleni wayagwe gaja gose gomulonda mweye kutendeligwa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Kamba mweye mowanogela wanhu owanogela mweye waiyeka, vino motenda kilozo gani? Hata wanhu wene nzambi owanogela waja owanogela hewo! <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Na kamba mowatendela ganogile waja owatendela ganogile waiyeka, vino motenda kilozo gani? Hata wanhu wene nzambi otenda vivo! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Na kamba mowakopesha waja waiyeka mutamanila odaha kuwabwezela, vino motenda kilozo gani? Hata wanhu wene nzambi owakopesha wayao otamanila odaha kuwabwezela kikija kiwawakopeshe! <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Lakini mweye wanogeleni waja omwihileni na muwatendele ganogile, muwakopeshe wanhu bila kutamanila kubwezeligwa. Abaho nhunza yenu yokuwa ng'hulu, na mweye mokuwa wana wa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani. Kwavija heyo kanoga kwa waja welibule nhogolwa kumwake na wanhu otenda nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Muwe na bazi kamba vija Tataenu viyeli na bazi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwatagusa wayagwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Sikumuwataguse wayagwe, Imulungu honda yawataguse mweye. Sikumuwalaumu wayagwe, na Imulungu honda yawalaumu mweye. Mugele kumgongo nzambi za wanhu wayagwe, na Imulungu kogela kumgongo nzambi zenu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Muwagwee wayagwe, na Imulungu kowagwaa mweye. Na mweye mobokela kibaba kimemile na kusindiligwa mbaka vokwitika mmakono genu, na vose vonda mudahe kuvigoga. Avo, vija vimuwapimila wayagwe, Imulungu nayo kowapimila vivo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Msuwameso hadaha kumulongoza msuwameso miyage. Yahatenda vivo, wose wabili olagalila mdikolombo. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Kuduhu mwanahina yombanza mfundiza wake. Lakini kila mwanahina yahamambukiza mafunzo gake, koigala na mfundiza wake.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Habali kolola kibanzi kili mdisiso da ndugu yako lakini hulola biki dili mdisiso jako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Hebu kodahaze kumulongela ndugu yako, ‘Chonde, leka nikulave kibanzi kili mdisiso jako,’ kuno gweye ung'hali hunajona biki dili mdisiso jako mwenyego? Gweye kwa mtapitapi! Tanhu lava biki dili mdisiso jako, abaho kodaha kulola goya na kulava kibanzi kili mdisiso da ndugu yako.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biki na matunda gake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Biki dinogile hadidaha kulela matunda gehile, na biki dihile hadidaha kulela matunda ganogile. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Kila biki dojuwika kwa matunda gake godilelaga, kwavija hudaha kubawa ngama mumkese hebu kubawa fulu kuna ivisolo va miba. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Munhu yanogile kolava ganogile mwiingama yake inogile ili muumoyo wake, lakini munhu yehile kolava gehile mwiingama yake ihile ili muumoyo wake. Kwavija munhu kolonga gaja gamemile muumoyo wake.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wazengaji wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Habali monikema, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa,’ kuno hamugatenda gaja goniwalongela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Munhu yoyose yokwiza kumwangu na kutegeleza mbuli zangu na kuzigoga nowalagusila kaigala na choni. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Kaigala na munhu yozenga ng'anda yake yahimbile hasi ng'hani, keka chandusilo chake mdibwe. Mvula ng'hulu viitowile, mazi gaitowa ing'anda, lakini hagadahile kuitigisa kwavija ikala izengigwe goya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yotegeleza mbuli zangu na kolema kuzigoga, kaigala na munhu yazengile ng'anda yake bila kuhimba chandusilo. Mvula ng'hulu viitowile, mazi gaitowa ng'anda ija, nayo igwa na kubanangika!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msang'hanaji wa mkulu imoja wa wakalizi wa Lumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayo 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kuwafundiza wanhu, kachola Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Ako kukala na mkulu imoja wa wakalizi gana wa Kilumi yakalile na msang'hanaji wake mtamu ng'hani, na kalonda kufa. Nayo mkulu ayo kakala yomnogela ng'hani msang'hanaji ayo.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Mkulu wa wakalizi gana wa Kilumi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Mkulu ayo viyahulike mbuli za Yesu, kawatuma wavele wayagwe wa Wayahudi wampule Yesu yeze kumuhonya msang'hanaji wake. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Avo wamcholela Yesu, wampula ng'hani, wamulongela, “Munhu ino kofaya umtaze. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Kowanogela wanhu na vivija katuzengela ng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Avo Yesu kachola nao. Viyakalile behi na ng'anda ya mkulu ija, mkulu ija kawatuma mbwiga zake wamulongele Yesu, “Go mkulu, sikuuigaze kwiza ukae, kwavija niye sifaya gweye wingile mng'anda yangu, <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>vivija niiyona sifaya hata kwiza kumwako. Lakini longa mbuli iiyeka, na msang'hanaji wangu kohona. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Kwavija na niye vivija na hasi ya udahi wa wakulu na nina wakalizi hasi yangu. Nahamulongela ino, ‘Chola!’ nayo kochola, nahamulongela iyagwe, ‘Izo!’ nayo kokwiza, vivija nahamulongela msang'hanaji wangu, ‘Tenda vino!’ nayo kotenda vivo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu viyahulike avo kakanganya ng'hani, kahinduka, kalulongela lunhu lwa wanhu lukalile lomkweleleza, “Nowalongela, sinamona munhu yeli na tamanilo kulu kamba dino, hata mwiisi ya Izilaeli!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Wanhu waja watumigwe wabwela kuna ing'anda ya mkulu ija, wamvika msang'hanaji ija kahona.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komzilibula mwana wa mgane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Kumwande, Yesu kachola kudibuga dimoja dikemigwe Naini. Kailongoza na wanahina zake na lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Viyakalile habehi na ulwivi mkulu wa kwingilila kudibuga dijo, wanhu wapapile maiti ga mbwanga wakala olawa kunze kudibuga, ochola kuzika. Mbwanga ayo yafile kakala mwana yeli yaiyeka wa mtwanzi yakalile mgane. Wanhu wengi wa buga ijo wakala hamoja na mtwanzi ayo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Mndewa Yesu viyamone mtwanzi ayo, kamonela bazi, kamulongela, “Sikuulile.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Abaho kagenda, kalukwasa ulusazi luwaitambalize maiti ya mbwanga ija. Wanhu walupapile ulusazi luja wema. Yesu kalonga, “Mbwanga! Nokulongela, lamuka.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Mbwanga ija yafile kalamuka, kasonga kulonga. Abaho Yesu kamgwaa mama ija mwanage.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Wanhu wose wengila bwembwe na wamtogola Imulungu. Walonga, “Mtula ndagu mkulu wa Imulungu katulawilila hamwetu! Imulungu keza kuwakombola wanhu zake!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Mbuli zino za Yesu zenela mwiisi yose ya Yudea na isi zili mmabehi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wasenga kulawa kwa Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Wanahina zake Yohana Mbatizaji wamulongela Yohana mbuli zose zino. Nayo kawakema wanahina zake wabili mna iwanahina zake, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>kawatuma wachole kwa Mndewa wakamuuze, “Vino gweye ayo ija iyalongile Yohana Mbatizaji kokwiza, hebu tumbete iyagwe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Viwavikile kwa Yesu, wamulongela, “Yohana Mbatizaji katutuma tukuuze, kamba gweye ayo ija yalongile kokwiza, hebu tumbete iyagwe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Kipindi kikija Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi wakalile watamu, wakalile ogaya, wakalile na vinyamkela na kawatenda wanhu wengi wakalile wasuwameso walole. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Avo Yesu kawedika, “Bweleni mkamulongele Yohana gaja gomuhulika na kugona, wasuwameso olola, mbetembete otembela, na weli na utamu wa dikulu ohonyigwa, na wanhu hawahulika ohulika, wafile ozilibuka, na wakiwa opeteligwa Mbuli Inogile. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Kamweda munhu ija yelibule shaka na niye!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Wanahina wa Yohana viwasegele, Yesu kasonga kululongela lunhu luja mbuli ya Yohana, “Vino vimucholile kuluwala, muchola kulola choni? Muchola kulola lusanze vilutigisigwa na beho? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Vino muchola kulola choni? Muchola kumulola munhu yavalile viwalo vinogile? Wanhu iwovala viwalo vinogile, weli na ugima wa kubwihila okala mzing'anda za wandewa! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Nongeleni, vino muchola kulola choni? Muchola kumulola mtula ndagu wa Imulungu? Ona, lakini mona vingi ng'hani kubanza mtula ndagu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Kwavija Yohana ayo yalongigwe mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, ‘Imulungu kalonga, nomtuma msenga wangu yakulongolele, yaitande nzila yako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Yesu kamambukiza kulonga, “Nowalongela, Yohana ni munhu mkulu kubanza munhu yoyose yakalile mwiisi. Lakini yeli mdodo Muundewa wa Imulungu ni munhu mkulu kubanza Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Wanhu wose wamuhulike, hata wabokela kodi, wamtogola Imulungu kamba kanoga na wakala wabatizigwe na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Lakini Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa walema kutenda ga Imulungu, kwavija walema kubatizigwa na Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Vino niwasimulile kwa lusimo gani wanhu wa lukolo luno? Vino waigala na choni? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Waigala na wana wadodo wakalile mdigulilo. Kibumbila kimoja chokikemelela kibumbila kiyagwe, ‘Tuwatowela ng'ombe sugu, lakini hamuvinile bule! Tuwembila nyila za kuindilo, lakini hamulilile bule!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Yohana Mbatizaji keza, kafunga kuja na hang'wile divai, mweye mulonga, ‘Kana kinyamkela!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Mwana wa Munhu keza, kaja na kung'wa, mweye mulonga, ‘Muloleni munhu ino! Mmelo na mulevi, mbwiga wa wabokela kodi na wanhu waja otenda nzambi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Lakini nzewele ya Imulungu yokoneka inoga kwa wanhu waja wose oitogola.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ukae kumwake Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mfalisayo imoja kamgoneka Yesu yakaje na heyo ndiya ya ichungulo. Avo Yesu kachola kuna ing'anda ya Mfalisayo, kakala na kuja. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Kudibuga dija kukala na mtwanzi imoja yakalile yotenda nzambi. Kahulika kamba Yesu kakala yoja mng'anda ya Mfalisayo ayo, avo kasola nyhupa ya alabasita imemile mavuta gonung'hila goya ga bei ng'hulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Kema kuchugu, habehi na magulu ga Yesu kolila, mahozi gake galagalila mgamagulu ga Yesu. Abaho kagahangusa magulu ga Yesu kwa mvili zake, kaganonela na kagagidila mavuta. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Mfalisayo ija viyone avo, kailongela, “Maza munhu ino yakalile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu, yahamjuwile mtwanzi ino yomgoga kavilihi, yahamjuwile kamema nzambi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Simoni, nina mbuli ya kukulongela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni kalonga, “Ona, Mfundiza, nongela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesu kasonga kumulongela, “Kukala na wanhu wabili wakopile sente kwa munhu yokopesha sente. Imoja kakopa sente magana matano, na iyagwe kakopa malongo matano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Wose wabili hawadahile kumuliha, avo munhu ija kawalekelela wose. Vino nani mna iwanhu waja yonda yamnogele ng'hani munhu ija?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni kamwidika, “Vinikona niye kokuwa ija yalekeleligwe sente nyingi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu kalonga, “Kulonga goya.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Abaho kamuhindukila mtwanzi ija na kamulongela Simoni, “Komona mtwanzi ino? Niza kuna ikae yako, hungwelele mazi ga kusunha magulu gangu, lakini mtwanzi ino kagasunha magulu gangu kwa mahozi gake na kagahangusa kwa mvili zake. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Gweye hunibokele kwa kuninonela, lakini mtwanzi ino halekile kuganonela magulu gangu tangu vinizile. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Hunibakile pala jangu mavuta, lakini mtwanzi ino kambakaza magulu gangu mavuta gonung'hila goya. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Nokulongela, nzambi zake nyingi zigeligwa kumgongo, lekaavo kalagusa unogelwa mkulu. Lakini munhu yoyose yeli na nzambi kidogo zigeligwe kumgongo, kolagusa unogelwa mdodo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ija, “Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile hamoja na Yesu kuna indiya, wasonga kuilongela, “Ino munhu gani yodaha kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Lakini Yesu kamulongela mtwanzi ija, “Kutamanila kwako kukukombola. Genda moyo uholile.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Watwanzi wacholile na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Hamwande Yesu kafunga mwanza, kabitila mna gamabuga na vijiji kowapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Imulungu. Wanahina zake longo na wabili wachola nayo. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Watwanzi wayagwe wakalile walavigwe vinyamkela na kuhonyigwa mitamu yao vivija wamkweleleza. Watwanzi awo wakala Malia, yakemigwe Magidalena, ija yalavigwe vinyamkela saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Yoana mwehe wake Kuza yakalile msang'hanaji mkulu mna ikae ya mndewa Helode, na Suzana, na watwanzi wayagwe wengi. Watwanzi awo wakala osola vinhu vao na kuwataza Yesu na wanahina zake.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa muhandaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Wanhu wagendelela kwiza kwa Yesu kulawa kila buga. Lunhu mkulu viluitig'hane hamoja, Yesu kalulongela lusimo luno.<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Kukala na munhu kachola kuhanda mbeyu mumgunda wake. Viyakalile komiza izimbeyu, mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mnzila, wanhu wazibojoga, na ndege wazija. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mdibwe hali na udongo kidogo. Vizotile, zinyala kwavija udongo ukala wabule unyefu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mna ivisolo va miba. Miba ikula na izizonga zimbeyu. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mna udongo unogile. Zikula na kulela mbeyu nyingi kubanza zija zihandigwe, kila mbeyu ilela miyanza malongo longo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu viyalongile avo, kalonga kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Munhu yeli na magwiti, yahulike!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simo zotufunza choni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Wanahina zake Yesu wamuuza fambulo da lusimo luno. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mutendigwa kuzijuwa mbuli zifisigwe za Undewa wa Imulungu. Lakini kwa wanhu wayagwe, nolonga kwa simo, ili walole lakini sikuwone, na wategeleze lakini sikuwajuwe.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula lusimo lwa muhandaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Dino ijo fambulo da muhandaji, mbeyu ni mbuli ya Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Zija zilagalile mnzila zolagusa wanhu waja iwohulika mbuli ya Imulungu, lakini Mwenembago kokwiza na kuisola mbuli ayo mmizoyo yao ili waleke kutogola na kukomboligwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mdibwe zolagusa wanhu waja oihulika mbuli ya Imulungu na kuibokela kwa kudeng'helela, lakini mbuli ayo haika mizizi mgati mmwao. Oitogola kwa kipindi kidodo, lakini wahagezigwa oileka mbuli ayo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mvisolo va miba zolagusa wanhu waja ohulika mbuli ya Imulungu, lakini viwogendelela, Mbuli ayo yozongigwa zongigwa na magayo, na utajili, na kudeng'helela vinhu va mwiisi. Wanhu awo hawalela bule matunda gonda gakangale. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Lakini mbeyu zilagalile hali na udongo unogile zolagusa wanhu waja iwohulika mbuli ya Imulungu na kuika mmizoyo yao na kuitogola, ofunga umoyo mbaka olela matunda.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taa kigubikigwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maluko 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>“Wanhu hawabwinha taa na kuigubika na kikalango hebu kuika muuvungu wa lusazi. Lakini oika hana ikingolobweda, ili wanhu viwokwingila wone mulenge.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“Kinhu chochose kifisigwe chokwikigwa hanhu hazelu, na kinhu chochose kigubikigwe chojuwika na kugaligwa hana umulenge.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>“Avo muiteganye na gaja gomuhulika, kwavija munhu yeli na kinhu kokongezeligwa, lakini ija yelibule kinhu kobokigwa hata kija kidodo kiyogesa kanacho.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mamake na ndugu zake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Mamake na ndugu zake Yesu wamcholela, lakini hawadahile kumvikila habehi mbuli ya lunhu lwa wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Munhu imoja kamulongela Yesu, “Mamako na ndugu zako wema kunze, olonda kukona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesu kawalongela wanhu wose, “Mamangu na ndugu zangu ni waja oihulika mbuli ya Imulungu na kuitenda.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodihoza beho kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakwela mwiingalawa hamoja na wanahina zake, kawalongela, “Tuloke umwambu.” Avo wasonga umwanza. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Viwakalile muumwanza, Yesu kawasa. Bahaja nyukwanyukwa da beho disonga kubuma mna idilamba, na ngalawa isonga kumema mazi, avo wose wakala mdizumozumo. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Wanahina wamgendela Yesu wamulamusa, wamulongela, “Go mkulu! Go mkulu! Tofa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu kalamuka, kadikomhokela beho na ng'humbi ya mazi. Vose vinyamala na kukala tuluu. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Abaho kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tamanilo jenu da kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Lakini awo wakanganya na kudumba, wailongela, “Ino munhu gani? Kodikomhokela beho na ng'humbi, navo vomuhulika!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulava munhu vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wavika kuna imwhani ya isi ya Wagelasi, muumwambu wa lamba kulawa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Viyahumuluke mwiingalawa, kamting'hana munhu imoja yeli na vinyamkela, yalawile kudibuga. Miyaka mingi munhu ayo kakala havala kiwalo wala hasinya ukae kumwake, lakini kakala yokala kuna gamapanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Viyamone Yesu, kaibwanha mmagulu ga Yesu, kaguta mizangi yolonga, “Gweye Yesu! Mwana wa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani! Kolonda kunitenda choni? Nokupula, sikuunidununze!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Kalonga avo kwavija Yesu kakala yamulagize ikinyamkela yamulawe munhu ayo. Miyanza mingi kinyamkela ayo kakala yomkumba munhu ayo. Hamoja wanhu wakala omgodeka mng'anda kuno makono gake na magulu gake gagodekigwa minyololo na mhingu, lakini kakala yokanha, na kinyamkela ayo kakala yomkimbiza mbaka kuluwala.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu kamuuza munhu ija, “Twaga jako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Kamwidika, “Twaga jangu Lunhu.” Kalonga avo kwavija vinyamkela wengi wakala wamkumbile. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Vinyamkela waja wampula Yesu sikuyawagale kuna dikolombo dikulu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Habehi na aho kukala na bumbila kulu da nguluwe wakalile oja kukigongo. Avo vinyamkela wampula Yesu yawatogolele wawakumbe nguluwe. Yesu kawatogolela. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Vinyamkela wamulawa munhu ija, wawengila nguluwe. Bumbila jose da nguluwe dihumulukila mwiingema ya idilamba, wengila mdilamba, wose wafa mgamazi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Wanhu wakalile owadima nguluwe awo wachona acho kilawilile, wakimbila na wazibwililisa mbuli azo kudibuga na mvijiji. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Wanhu wachola kulola kija kilawilile. Viwavikile kwa Yesu, wamona munhu ija yalavigwe vinyamkela kakala mmagulu ga Yesu, kavala viwalo, kana nzewele zake. Wanhu wose wadumba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Na waja wayonile mbuli ayo, wawalongela wanhu vija munhu ayo yakalile na vinyamkela viyahonyigwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Abaho wanhu wose wa isi ija ya Wagelasi wampula Yesu yalawanye, kwavija wakala wadumbile ng'hani. Avo Yesu kakwela mwiingalawa na kulawanya. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Munhu ija yalavigwe vinyamkela kampula Yesu wachole wose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Lakini Yesu hamtogolele, kamulongela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Bwela ukae kumwako ukawalongele wanhu gose gayakutendele Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Avo munhu ija kachola kila hanhu kudibuga dija, kawapetela wanhu mbuli zose ziyatendeligwe na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mndele wa Yailo na mtwanzi yakwasile kiwalo cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Yesu viyabwelile mwambu uyagwe wa lamba, wanhu wambokela kwa deng'ho kwavija wose wakala ombeta. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Abaho keza munhu imoja, twaga jake Yailo. Munhu ayo kakala mkulu wa ng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu. Kamfugamila Yesu, kampula yachole ukae kumwake, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>kwavija mndele wake yeli yaiyeka kakala mmabehi kufa. Mndele ayo kakala na miyaka longo na mibili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu viyakalile kochola, wanhu wakala omsung'ha sung'ha kila mwambu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Mna dibumbila dija da wanhu, kukala na mtwanzi imoja yakalile na utamu wa kutumika kwa miyaka longo na mibili. Kakala yamambukize vinhu vake vose kwa waganga, lakini kuduhu munhu yadahile kumuhonya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Mtwanzi ija kamcholela Yesu kuchugu, kakwasa mhindo ya kiwalo cha Yesu, bahaja kutumika kuleka. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu kauza, “Nani yanikwasile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Wanhu wose wabela. Petulo kalonga, “Go mkulu, wanhu wose wakuzunguluka na kukusung'ha sung'ha.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Lakini Yesu kalonga, “Kuna munhu kanikwasa, kwavija nihulika nguvu zinilawa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mtwanzi ija viyone hadaha kuifisa, keza yogwaya, kaibwanha mmagulu ga Yesu. Baho mgameso ga wanhu, kamulongela Yesu habali kakwasa mhindo ya kiwalo chake, na vija viyahonyigwe bahaja. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mwanangu, kutamanila kwako kukuhonya. Chola moyo uholile.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga, msenga kulawa ukae kumwake Yailo keza, kamulongela Yailo, “Mndele wako kamala kufa, avo sikuumgaze Mfundiza.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Lakini Yesu viyahulike avo, kamulongela Yailo, “Sikuudumbe, gweye togola tu, mndele wako kohona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Viyavikile kuna ing'anda ya Yailo, Yesu kawagomesa wanhu sikuwengile hamoja nayo, ila kengila na Petulo na Yohana, na Yakobo na tatake na mamake mndele ayo. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Wanhu wose wakala olila na kumuyalalila imwana. Yesu kawalongela, “Sikumulile, kwavija imwana hafile bule, kawasa tu!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Wanhu wose wamseka kwavija wakala wajuwile imwana kakala yafile. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Lakini Yesu kamgoga mkono, kamulongela, “Mwanangu, lamuka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Ugima wake umbwelela mndele ija, bahaja kalamuka. Abaho Yesu kawalagiza wamgwee ndiya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Tatake na mamake wakanganya ng'hani, lakini Yesu kawagomesa sikuwamulongele munhu yoyose kija kilawilile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma wanahina zake longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu kawakema hamoja wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawagwaa nguvu na udahi wa kulava vinyamkela na kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Abaho kawatuma wachole wakawapetele wanhu usenga wa Undewa wa Imulungu na kuhonya watamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Kawalongela, “Sikumusole kinhu chochose muumwanza wenu. Sikumusole mkongoja, wala mkoba, wala ndiya, wala sente, wala viwalo vibili. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ng'anda yoyose yonda mwingile na kugonekigwa, kaleni mumo mbaka vonda musegele mna idibuga dijo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Wanhu wahalema kuwabokela, segeleni buga dijo na kung'huseni timbwisi dili mmagulu genu kiwe kilaguso kamba wawatendela nzambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Wanahina wafunga mwanza, wabitila vijiji vose owapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile na kuwahonya wanhu kila hanhu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Helode konyawanyawa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Helode yakalile mndewa wa Galilaya, kahulika mbuli zose ziyatendile Yesu. Kanyawanyawa ng'hani, kwavija wanhu wakala olonga Yohana Mbatizaji kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Wanhu wayagwe walonga Eliya kalawilila, wayagwe walonga imoja wa watula ndagu wa Imulungu wa umwaka kazilibuka kulawa kuna iwanhu wafile. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Lakini Helode kalonga, “Yohana nimkanha dipala, vino ino ayo nani inihulika mbuli zake?” Nayo kalonda kumona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa ndiya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Watumigwa waja viwabwelile, wamulongela Yesu kila kinhu wakitendile. Yesu kawasola, kachola nao waiyeka kuna dibuga dikemigwe Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Lakini wanhu viwajuwile avo, wamkweleleza Yesu. Nayo kawabokela, kalonga nao mbuli ya Undewa wa Imulungu na kawahonya waja wakalile watamu.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Zuwa vidisongile kuhonga, wanahina longo na wabili wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Walongele wanhu wachole kuna ivijiji na migunda ili behi na hano wakazahile ndiya na hanhu ha kuwasa, kwavija hano hatwili twa kuluwala.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye wagweleleni ndiya waje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Lakini wao wamwidika, “Tuna magate matano na somba wabili tu. Kolonda tuchole tukawagulile ndiya lunhu lose luno?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Wambigalo waiyeka wakalile hanhu aho wakala ovika elufu tano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Walongeleni wanhu wakale mna ivibumbila va wanhu malongo matano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Nao wanahina watenda vivo. Wanhu wose wakala hasi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Abaho Yesu kagasola magate matano na somba wabili, kalola uchanha kuulanga, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kagabanzula gamagate na iwasomba, kawagwaa wanahina zake wawagwelele wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Wanhu wose waja na kwiguta. Wanahina zake wasola vigelo longo na vibili vimemile vinhu visigale.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo komtogola Yesu ayo Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maluko 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala yaiyeka kompula Imulungu. Wanahina zake wamcholela, nayo kawauza, “Vino wanhu olonga niye na nani?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Wamwidika, “Wanhu wayagwe olonga gweye kwa Yohana Mbatizaji, wayagwe olonga kwa Eliya, kuno wayagwe olonga gweye kwa imoja wa watula ndagu wa Imulungu wa umwaka yazilibuke kulawa kwa wafile.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Yesu kawauza, “Na mweye molonga niye na nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye kwa Kilisito, wa Imulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Abaho Yesu kawagomesa wanahina zake sikuwamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ayo.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maluko 8:30-9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Vivija Yesu kawalongela, “Mwana wa Munhu kolondigwa yadununzike ng'hani, na kulemigwa na wavele na wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Kokomigwa lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanhu wose, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kunikweleleza, yaileme mwenyego, yaidikwe msalaba wake kila siku, yanikweleleze. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yolonda kuukombola ugima wake mwenyego kowagiza, lakini munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake mbuli ya niye, koukombola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Vino munhu yahapata kila kinhu mwiisi, lakini kowagiza ugima wake, munhu ayo kopata choni? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Kamba munhu konyonela kinyala niye na mafundizo gangu, Mwana wa Munhu nayo yaheza muukulu wake na wa Tatake na wasenga wa kuulanga wang'alile komonela kinyala munhu ayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Lakini nowalongela ukweli, wanhu wayagwe wemile hano honda wafe mbaka wawone Undewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaluka ikihanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maluko 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Vizibitile siku nane toka yalonge mbuli azo, Yesu kawasola Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo kachola nao kukigongo kumpula Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Viyakalile kompula Imulungu, kihanga chake kigaluka, viwalo vake vikala vizelu chuwee! <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Bahaja wanhu wabili wakala aho olonga nayo. Nao wakala Musa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>wakoneka muukulu, wakala olonga na Yesu mbuli ya ifa yake yonda yaimambukize ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Petulo na wayage wakala okuluza. Viwalamuke, wawona ukulu wa Yesu na wanhu wabili wemile nayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Wanhu waja viwakalile osegela, Petulo kamulongela Yesu, “Go mkulu, vinoga siye tukale hano! Tuzenge viheha vidatu, kimoja chako, kimoja cha Musa na kimoja cha Eliya.” Petulo kakala hajuwa bule kija kiyolonga.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Petulo yang'hali yolonga, wingu dilawilila, diwagubika na kungugu jake, wanahina wadumba ng'hani wingu dijo vidiwagubike. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Sauti ilonga kulawa mdiwingu, “Ino ayo Mwanangu inimsagule. Mtegelezeni!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Sauti ayo viinyamale, Yesu kasigala yaiyeka. Wanahina wanyamala tuluu, na kipindi kija hawamulongele munhu yoyose kija kiwone.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komulava mbwanga imoja kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maluko 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Imitondo yake Yesu na wanahina zake wadatu wahumuluka kukigongo. Lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu luiting'hana na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Munhu imoja mna ulunhu kaguta, “Mfundiza! Nokupula undolele mwanangu, mwanangu yeli yaiyeka! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Kinyamkela komkumba na komtenda yagute nyangi, komgela kisango kuno kolawa miholovu mmulomo. Kogendelela kumulumiza na hamuleka hima bule! <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Niwapula wanahina zako wamulave kinyamkela ayo, lakini hawadahile bule.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye lukolo lulibule kutamanila na lwagile! Nokala na mweye mbaka lini? Nogela kitumbe kumgongo mbaka lini?” Abaho kamulongela munhu ija, “Mgale hano mwanago.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Mbwanga ija viyakalile komwizila Yesu, kinyamkela kambwanha hasi na kamgela kisango. Lakini Yesu kamkomhokela kinyamkela, kamuhonya mbwanga ija, na kamgwaa tatake. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya kwa udahi mkulu wa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu kolonga kabili mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Wanhu viwakalile wang'hali okanganya mbuli ziyatendile Yesu, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Sikumuisemwe mbuli inilonda kuwalongela! Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Lakini wanahina zake hawajuwile fambulo da ulonzi awo. Ukala ufisigwe kumwao avo hawadahile kuujuwa, nao wadumba kumuuza Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nani yeli munhu mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Wanahina wa Yesu wasonga kuibamilila wao kwa wao nani yeli munhu mkulu viweli. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesu kakijuwa kiwakalile ogesa, kamsola mwana mdodo, kamwika behi nayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>Abaho kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu yoyose yombokela mwana ino kwa twaga jangu, konibokela niye, na munhu yoyose yombokela niye, kombokela ija yanhumile. Kwavija munhu yeli mdodo vimwili, ayo munhu mkulu kubanza wose.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu hamwihilani mweye miyenu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maluko 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yohana kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, tumona munhu kolava vinyamkela kwa twaga jako. Tumgomesa kwavija halawa mkibumbila chetu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesu kamulongela Yohana na wanahina wayagwe, “Sikumumgomese, kwavija munhu yoyose hamwihilani mweye miyenu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa kijiji cha Samalia olema kumbokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Kipindi cha Yesu kugaligwa kuulanga vikikalile mmabehi, kagangamala, kachola Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Kawatuma wasenga wamulongolele wachole kuna ikijiji kili mwiisi ya Samalia kumtandila kila kinhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Lakini wanhu wa kijiji cha Samalia hawambokele Yesu, kwavija wajuwa kamba kakala kochola Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Wanahina zake, Yakobo na Yohana viwone avo, walonga, “Mndewa, kolonda tulagize moto kulawa kuulanga uwasakaze wose?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yesu kahinduka kawakomhokela. Kawalongela, “Hamujuwile bule loho gani imulinayo, kwavija Mwana wa Munhu hezile kuubananga ugima wa wanhu lakini keza kuukombola.” <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Abaho Yesu na wanahina zake wachola kuna ikijiji kiyagwe.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu ofaya kumkweleleza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Viwakalile mnzila, munhu imoja kamulongela Yesu, “Nokukweleleza kokose konda uchole.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Vizongo wana mhango na ndege wana mvulu, lakini Mwana wa Munhu kabule hanhu ha kubwihila na kutambalala.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yesu kamulongela munhu iyagwe, “Nikweleleze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Lakini munhu ija kalonga, “Go mkulu, beta tanhu mbwele ukae hamzike tatangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Waleke wanhu wafile wawazike wanhu wafile wayao. Lakini gweye chola ukawapetele wanhu Undewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Munhu iyagwe kalonga, “Go mkulu, nokukweleleza, lakini beta tanhu halulage lukolo lwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Munhu yoyose yokwaluka kulima abaho kolola kuchugu, hafaya Muundewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma wanhu malongo saba na wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Abaho Mndewa Yesu kawasagula wanhu wayagwe malongo saba na wabili, kawatuma wabili wabili wamulongolele kila kijiji na kila hanhu kuyalondile kuchola. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Kawalongela, “Kuna ndiya nyingi lakini wasang'hanaji wadodo. Mpuleni Mndewa wa indiya yawatume wasang'hanaji mumgunda wake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Gendeni! Nowatuma mweye kamba ng'hondolo mna iwambwizi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Sikumusole mfuko hebu mkoba hebu vilatu. Sikumwime na kumulamusa munhu yoyose mnzila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Ng'anda yoyose yonda mwingile, tanhu mulonge, ‘Tindiwalo dikale mng'anda ino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Kamba hana munhu kodinogela tindiwalo, tindiwalo jenu dokala nayo, kamba kuduhu munhu yodinogela tindiwalo, tindiwalo jenu dowabwelela. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Mkale mng'anda ayo, diyeni na kung'wa chochose chonda wawagwelele, kwavija msang'hanaji kolondigwa yapate malipo gake. Sikumuhamehame kulawa ng'anda imoja kuchola iyagwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Buga jojose donda mwingile na kubokeligwa, diyeni vija vonda wawagwelele. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Wahonyeni watamu weli kuko, na muwalongele, ‘Undewa wa Imulungu wa behi yenu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Lakini buga jojose donda mwingile na wanhu olema kuwabokela, laweni mumo, na vimubita kuna zinzila zao, mulonge, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Hata matimbwisi ga buga jenu gatunanahile mmagulu getu togakung'husa kiwe kilaguso kumwenu kamba mututendela gehile. Lakini mujuwe kamba Undewa wa Imulungu wammabehi!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Nowalongela ukweli, mna isiku ya nhaguso, Imulungu kolagusa bazi ng'hani kwa wanhu wa buga da Sodoma kubanza wanhu wa buga dijo!<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabuga golema kutogola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Kogaya gweye buga da Kolazini! Kogaya gweye buga da Betisaida! Maza unzonza utendigwe kumwenu mweye wahatendigwe mna gamabuga ga Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu zake wahalekile mwaka nzambi zao na kuvala magunia na kuibakaza mitozi, kulagusa kamba waleka nzambi! <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Mwiisiku ya nhaguso, Imulungu kolagusa bazi ng'hani kwa wanhu wa mabuga ga Tilo na Sidoni kubanza mweye. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Gweye buga da Kapelinaumu, vino kolonda kuinula mwenyego mbaka uchanha kuulanga? Mawe! Kohumulusigwa mbaka kowochola wanhu wafile!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu yoyose yowategeleza mweye, konhegeleza niye, na yoyose yowalema mweye, kondema niye. Na munhu yoyose yondema niye, komulema ija yanhumile.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa waja malongo saba na wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Abaho wanhu waja malongo saba na wabili wabwela kuno odeng'helela. Walonga, “Mndewa, hata vinyamkela watutegeleza vituwakomhokele kwa twaga jako!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>YesTegelezeni! Niwagwaa udahi, avo modaha kukanyaga mgendela hasi na inge na kuzihuma nguvu zose za Mwenembago. Kuduhu kinhu chonda kiwalumize.u kawedika, “Nimona Mwenembago kolagala kulawa kuulanga kamba lumwesa. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Tegelezeni! Niwagwaa udahi, avo modaha kukanyaga mgendela hasi na inge na kuzihuma nguvu zose za Mwenembago. Kuduhu kinhu chonda kiwalumize. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Lakini sikumudeng'helele kwavija vinyamkela owategeleza, ila deng'heleleni kwavija matwaga genu gandikigwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodeng'helela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Kipindi kija Yesu kadeng'helela kwa udahi wa Loho Yang'alile, kalonga, “Tata, Mndewa wa kuulanga na mwiisi! Nokutogola kwavija kuwafisa mbuli zino wanhu weli na nzewele na ubala, na kuwagubulila wana wadodo. Ona, Tata, vino vivo viulondile.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>“Tatangu kanigwaa vinhu vose. Kuduhu munhu yamjuwile Mwana ila Tata yaiyeka, na kuduhu munhu yamjuwile Tata ila Mwana na waja wose Mwana yawasagule kuwagubulila wamjuwe Tata.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Abaho Yesu kawahindukila wanahina zake, kalonga nao kinyelegezi, “Wamweda wanhu wose ovona vinhu vimona mweye! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Nowalongela ukweli, watula ndagu wengi wa Imulungu na wandewa walonda kuvona vimona mweye, lakini hawavonile bule, na vivija walonda kuhulika vimuhulika mweye, lakini hawahulike bule.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa Msamalia yanogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Munhu imoja yagajuwile goya Malagizo ga Musa, kachola kwa Yesu yamgeze. Avo kamuuza, “Mfundiza, vino nhende choni niupate ugima wa milele?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vino, Malagizo golongaze na gweye kogajuwaze?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Munhu ija kamwidika, “ ‘Mnogele Mndewa Imulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose, na kwa loho yako yose, na kwa nguvu zako zose, na kwa nzewele zako zose,’ na ‘Umnogele miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kulonga goya, tenda vivo na gweye kokuwa na ugima.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Lakini munhu ija kalonda kuilagusa kamba kanoga, avo kamuuza Yesu, “Vino miyangu ayo nani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Munhu imoja kakala kolawa Yelusalemu kochola Yeliko. Mnzila, wabavi wamgoga, wamboka vinhu vake, na kumtowa, wamuleka habehi na kufa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Abaho mulava nhosa imoja kakala yohumuluka kubitila nzila iija. Viyamone, kainega, kabitila kumgwazo. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Vivija Mlawi imoja viyavikile aho, kamulola munhu ija, nayo kainega, kabitila kumgwazo. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Lakini Msamalia imoja yakalile muumwanza kavika aho hayakalile munhu ija. Nayo viyamone, kamonela bazi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Kamcholela, kamgela mavuta na divai mna ivilonda vake na kavifunga goya. Abaho kamkweza mumgongo wa kihongwe wake, kamgala mbaka kuna ing'anda ya wageni na kumulolesa goya. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Imitondo yake kalava sente kamgwaa mwene ng'anda, kamulongela, ‘Mulolese goya munhu ino. Chochose chonda umsang'hanile, nahabwela nokugwaa fungu jako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Abaho Yesu kamuuza, “Viukona gweye, mna iwanhu awo wadatu, nani yakalile miyage munhu ija yatoigwe na wabavi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Munhu ija kamwidika, “Ija yamonele bazi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu kamulongela, “Na gweye genda ukatende vivo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatembelela Mata na Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwakalile mnzila, wengila kuna ikijiji kimoja. Mtwanzi imoja twaga jake Mata kambokela ukae kumwake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Mata kakala na mdodo wake yakemigwe Malia, yakalile hasi behi na magulu ga Yesu na kutegeleza mafundizo gake. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Lakini Mata kakala yohunganika na sang'hano nyingi ziyalondeke kusang'hana, avo kamcholela Yesu, kamulongela, “Mndewa, vino hutonga bule kamba mdodo wangu kanilekela sang'hano zose nisang'hane niiyeka? Mulongele yeze yanitaze!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Lakini Mndewa kamwidika, “Gwee Mata gwee! Kohunganika na kugaya kwa vinhu vingi, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>lakini kimoja kiiyeka kilondigwa. Malia kasagula kinhu kinogile, na honda kisegesigwe bule kumwake.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza kumpula Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala hanhu kompula Imulungu. Viyamambukize, mwanahina wake imoja kamulongela, “Mndewa, tufundize kupula, kamba vija Yohana viyawafundize wanahina zake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mwahampula Imulungu, longeni vino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tataetu uli kuulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Twaga jako ditogoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Undewa wako wize.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Utugwee lelo ndiya ya kila siku.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Uzigele kumgongo nzambi zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kamba vija siye vituzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Sikuutugele mmagezo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu gani kumwenu yeli na mbwiga yahamcholela kilo kikulu na kumulongela, ‘Mbwigangu, ng'hopeshe magate madatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>kwavija mbwigangu keza, kalawa mwanza, na niye nabule ndiya ya kumgwaa!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>na ija yeli mng'anda yamwidike, ‘Sikuunigaze! Lwivi luhindigwa mwaka, na niye na wanangu tuwasa, avo sidaha kulamuka kukugwaa kinhu chochose.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Nowalongela vino, hata yahalema kulamuka na kumgwaa magate kwavija mbwigake, lakini kwavija kabule kinyala kugendelela kumpula, kolamuka na kumgwaa kila kinhu kiyopula.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>“Avo nowalongela, puleni na mweye mogweleligwa, zahileni na mweye movona, gong'ondeni ulwivi na mweye movugulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Kwavija waja wose ompula Imulungu ogweleligwa, na waja ozahila opata, na lwivi lovuguligwa kwa munhu yoyose yogong'onda. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Vino kuna munhu yoyose kumwenu kamba mwanage yahampula somba, heyo komgwaa zoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Hebu yahampula finga komgwaa inge? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Kamba mweye wene nzambi mojuwa kuwagwaa wanenu vinhu vinogile, lakini Tataenu yeli kuulanga kowagwaa ng'hani Loho Yang'alile wanhu waja ompula.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maluko 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala komulava kinyamkela yamtendile munhu imoja yalemelwe kulonga. Kinyamkela ayo viyamulawile, munhu ija kasonga kulonga. Lunhu lwa wanhu lukanganya ng'hani, <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>lakini wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Belizebuli, mkulu wa vinyamkela, ayo yomgwaa udahi wa kulava vinyamkela.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Wanhu wayagwe walonda kumgeza Yesu, avo wampula yatende kilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Lakini Yesu kakijuwa kiwakalile okigesa, avo kawalongela, “Undewa wowose wahaigola mna ivibumbila na kuitowa, undewa awo ofa, na lubuga lumoja lwahaigola, lubuga lulo lofa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Avo kamba undewa wa Mwenembago wahaigola mvibumbila na kuitowa, undewa awo okwimaze? Mweye molonga niye nolava vinyamkela kwavija Belizebuli konigwaa udahi wa kutenda vivo. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Kamba nolava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa Belizebuli, avo wanhu wenu olava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa nani? Kwa mbuli ayo wanhu wenu wenyego owatagusa kamba mobananga! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Lakini kamba nowalava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa Imulungu, avo mujuwe kamba Undewa wa Imulungu uvika mwaka kumwenu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Munhu mwene nguvu viyokaliza ng'anda yake kwa silaha, vinhu vake havisoligwa bule. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Lakini yaheza munhu mwene nguvu kubanza heyo, komtowa na kumuhuma, komboka silaha zake ziyatamanile na koigolela na wayage vija viyasolile.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“Munhu yoyose heli ubanzi wangu konilema, na munhu yoyose yolema kunitaza kwika hamoja, ayo kopwililisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Kinyamkela yahamulawa munhu, kochola mwiisi inyalile kuzahila hanhu ha kubwihila. Yahaswela, koilongela, ‘Nobwela ukayangu kunilawile.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Yahabwela na kuivika ng'anda ifagiligwa na kila kinhu kikigwa goya, <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>baho kobwela na kuwagala vinyamkela wayagwe saba wehile kubanza heyo, awo okwiza na kukala mumo. Avo ugima wa munhu ayo okuwa wiha kubanza aho haichanduso.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Deng'ho da kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesu yang'hali yolonga, mtwanzi imoja kulawa kuna ulunhu kamulongela kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Kamweda mtwanzi yakulelile na kukukong'heza!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Wamweda ng'hani wanhu wose ohulika mbuli ya Imulungu na kuigoga!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu olonda unzonza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Wanhu viwakalile omsung'ha sung'ha, Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Lukolo luno lwa wanhu otenda nzambi! Lolonda kilaguso, lakini kuduhu kilaguso chochose chonda wagweleligwe, ila kilaguso cha Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Kamba vija mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Yona viyakalile kilaguso kwa wanhu wa Ninawi, vivo ili kwa Mwana wa Munhu vonda yawe kilaguso kwa wanhu wa lukolo luno. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Mna isiku ya nhaguso, Malikia wa Sheba kokwima na kuwatagusa mweye kamba mubananga, kwavija heyo kafunga mwanza kulawa mwiisi yake kachola kumtegeleza Mndewa Sulemani na mafundizo gake geli na nzewele. Nowalongela, hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Sulemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Mna isiku ya nhaguso, wanhu wa Ninawi okwima na kuwatagusa mweye, kwavija awo waleka nzambi Yona viyawapetele. Lakini nowalongela, hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mulenge wa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Kuduhu munhu yobwinha taa na kuigubika na kikalango, lakini koika kukingolobweda, ili wanhu okwingila mng'anda wone mulenge. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Meso gako mulukuli lwako gaigala na taa. Kamba meso gako magima, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa na mulenge, lakini meso gako gahabanangika, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa mdiziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Muiteganye, mulenge uli mgati mmwenu sikuuwe ziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Kamba lukuli lwako lose lwahawa na mulenge, na kuduhu hanhu heli na ziza, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa na lenge eka, kamba vija taa viimwemwesa mulenge wake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalonga Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga, Mfalisayo imoja kamgoneka ukae kumwake wakaje hamoja, avo Yesu kengila mng'anda, kakala hasi, kasonga kuja. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Mfalisayo ayo kakanganya ng'hani viyamone Yesu koja bila kusunha makono gake. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Avo Mndewa kamulongela, “Mweye Mafalisayo mosunha vikasi na sahani kwa kunze, lakini mgati mmwenu mmema ubokaji na gehile. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Mweye mwa wabozi! Vino siyo Imulungu yavitendile va kunze na va mgati vivija? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Lakini laveni vili mgati na muwagwee wakiwa na kila kinhu chonoga kumwenu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Mogaya mweye Mafalisayo! Kwavija momgwaa Imulungu fungu da longo da majani gonung'hila goya kamba vija binzali na kalafuu, na mboga ziyagwe, lakini moleka kutenda ganogile kwa wanhu na kumnogela Imulungu. Molondigwa kutenda gano na sikumugaleke gago gayagwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Mogaya mweye Mafalisayo! Kwavija monogelwa kukala kuna ivigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na kulamusigwa mna gamagulilo. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Mogaya mweye! Kwavija muigala na mapanga hagakoneka, wanhu obita uchanha bila kugajuwa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Munhu imoja yagajuwile goya Malagizo ga Musa kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, wahalonga avo, kotuliga siye vivija!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vivija mogaya mweye mugajuwile goya Malagizo ga Musa! Kwavija mowapapiza wanhu mizigo mikulu, lakini mweye wenyego hamulonda kugolosa makono kuwataza kupapa. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Mogaya mweye, kwavija mogazengela goya mapanga ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu, waja wakomigwe na wahenga zenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Mweye wenyego mokitogola kija kiwatendile wahenga zenu, kwavija wao wawakoma watula ndagu wa Imulungu, na mweye mogazengela goya mapanga gao. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Kwa mbuli ayo, nzewele ya Imulungu ilonga, ‘Nowatuma watula ndagu wa Imulungu na watumigwa, wayagwe owakoma na wayagwe owadununza!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Avo wanhu wa lukolo luno otagusigwa mbuli ya kuwakoma watula ndagu wose wa Imulungu, kulawa kuna ichanduso cha isi, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>toka kukomigwa kwa Habili mbaka kukomigwa kwa Zakalia, ija yakomigwe hagati ha upango wa kulavila nhosa na Hanhu Hong'ala. Ona, nowalongela, wanhu wa lukolo luno otagusigwa kwa kuwakoma wao!”<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa! Kwavija mofisa luvugulo lwa kuvugulila lwivi lwa ng'anda ya kuifunzila. Mweye wenyego hamwingila bule, abaho muwagomesa waja wakalile olonda kwingila sikuwengile!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesu viyasegele hanhu aho, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wasonga kumulonga vihile na kumuuza mbuli nyingi, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>wageza kumnamata kwa mbuli zake zonda yalonge.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowazuma wanhu mbuli ya utapitapi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayo 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Wanhu wengi waiting'hana hamoja mbaka wanhu wakala oikanyaga. Tanhu Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Iteganyeni na hamila ya Mafalisayo, nao ndo utapitapi. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Kinhu chochose kigubikigwe chogubuligwa, na kija kifisigwe chojuwika. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Avo chochose kimulongile mdiziza chohulikigwa mmulenge, na chochose kimunyong'onye mwiiyeka mdigati dihindigwe chopetigwa mkiswili.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ija wa kumdumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Nowalongela mweye mbwiga zangu, sikumuwadumbe wanhu waja oukoma lukuli, abaho hawadaha kutenda kinhu kiyagwe chochose kihile. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Lakini nowalagusila wa kumdumba, mdumbeni Imulungu, heyo yahakoma, kana udahi wa kumwasa munhu muumoto wa jehanamu. Nowalongeleni, mdumbeni ayo!<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Vino nhongwa watano hawachuuzigwa kwa sente ndodo mbili? Lakini kuduhu hata imoja yosemwigwa na Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Hata mvili zili mmapala genu zipetigwa zose. Avo sikumudumbe. Mweye munoga ng'hani kubanza nhongwa wengi!<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtogola na kumulema Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Nowalongeleni ukweli, munhu yoyose yonitogola niye mgameso ga wanhu, Mwana wa Munhu nayo komtogola mgameso ga wasenga wa Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yonibela niye mgameso ga wanhu, Mwana wa Munhu nayo kombela mgameso ga wasenga wa Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“Munhu yoyose yomulonga vihile Mwana wa Munhu, nzambi zake zogeligwa kumgongo, lakini munhu yoyose yomuliga Loho Yang'alile, nzambi zake honda zigeligwe kumgongo bule.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Wahawagala haulongozi wa ng'anda za kumpula Imulungu, na mgameso ga wakulu wa isi na wandewa, sikumunyawenyawe vija vonda mwidike hebu kija chonda mulonge. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Kwavija Loho Yang'alile kowafundiza saa iija gaja gomulondigwa kulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa tajili mbozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Munhu imoja muulunhu kamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, mulongele ndugu yangu tuigolele uhazi wa tataetu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mbwigangu, nani yanigwelele udahi wa kuwalamula hebu kuwagolela uhazi wenu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Abaho kagendelela kuwalongela wose, “Muiteganye na ugila! Kwavija ugima wa munhu hautamanila wingi wa vinhu viyelinavo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Kukala na munhu imoja yakalile na mgunda uli na ndiya nyingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Kasonga kugelegeza mwenyego, ‘Nabule hanhu ha kwika ndiya yangu yose. Nhendeze?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Abaho kailongela, ‘Notenda vino, nogatula makanho gangu na kuzenga makulu ng'hani. Mumo nokwika ndiya yangu na vinhu vangu viyagwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Abaho noilongela, gweye moyo wangu! Kuna vinhu vose vinogile kwa miyaka heleketwaa. Bwihila, diya, ing'wa, na kudeng'helela!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Lakini Imulungu kamulongela, ‘Gweye kwa mbozi! Kilo cha lelo noulonda ugima wako, abaho vinhu vose vino viuikile vokuwa va nani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Abaho Yesu kamambukiza kulonga, “Vino vivo ili kwa waja oikila vinhu vao wenyego, lakini haweka vinhu vao kwa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtamanila Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Nowalongela, sikumuigaiye ndiya imulonda ili muwe wagima, hebu viwalo vimulonda kwa ng'huli zenu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Kwavija ugima unoga kubanza ndiya, na lukuli lunoga kubanza viwalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Waloleni bondwa, hawahanda, hawasenga, wabule makanho, lakini Imulungu kowadima! Vino Imulungu hawanogela ng'hani mweye kubanza iwabondwa? <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Nani kumwenu kwa kuigaza ng'hani kodaha kwengeza hata saa dimoja da ugima wake? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Kamba hamudaha kutenda mbuli ndodo kamba ino, habali moigaza kwa mbuli ziyagwe? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Galoleni maluwa vigokula. Hagasang'hana hebu hagaisonela viwalo. Lakini nowalongela kweli, hata mndewa Sulemani, hamoja na utajili wake wose kakala kabule viwalo vinogile viigalile na maluwa gano. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Kamba Imulungu heyo yodivaza jani da kumuhulo, lelo dabahano na mayo dokwasigwa muumoto, vino hondayawavaze ng'hani mweye? Mweye wanhu mutamanila kidogo!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Avo sikumuigaze moja choni, hebu mong'wa choni. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Kwavija vinhu avo, vivo voogaiya wanhu haweli Wayahudi. Tataenu yeli kuulanga kojuwa molonda vinhu vose avo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Lakini uzahileni tanhu Undewa wa Imulungu, nayo kowagwaa vinhu avo.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Utajili wa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Sikumudumbe mweye kibumbila kidodo cha wanahina zangu, kwavija Tataenu kanogelwa kuwagwaa mweye Undewa. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Chuuzeni vose vimulinavo na muwagwelele wakiwa zisente. Muitendele mikoba hailala, na muikile ngama yenu kuulanga. Ako hondaihunguke, kwavija kuduhu wabavi odaha kuhavika na kuduhu ng'hobo odaha kuibananga. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Kwavija kuko kuili ngama yako, vivija kuko kondauwe moyo wako.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wasang'hanaji welimeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Muitande na kuifunga mikwiji mvigudi, na taa zenu ziwe zokwaka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>kamba wasang'hanaji viwombetela mkulu wao yabwele kulawa kuna idizengele. Yahabwela na kugong'onda ulwivi, himahima omvugulila. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Wamweda wasang'hanaji waja mkulu wao yahabwela kowavika meso! Nowalongeleni ukweli, mkulu ayo kosaula koti jake, kowalongela wakale hasi hana indiya na heyo kowasang'hanila. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Wamweda wasang'hanaji waja mkulu wao kowavika wang'hali meso, hata kamba yahabwela kilo kikulu hebu nzogolo zikwika! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Lakini mujuwe vino, kamba mwene ng'anda yahajuwile saa ya kwiza mbavi, yahakalile meso, na sambi yaileke ng'anda yake ituligwe na mbavi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Na mweye vivija molondigwa mwiitande, kwavija Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza mna isaa hamuigesile.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Msang'hanaji yotamaniligwa na hatamaniligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Mndewa, vino lusimo luno kutulongela siye twiiyeka, hebu kuwalongela wanhu wose?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Mndewa kamwidika, “Vino msang'hanaji gani yotamaniligwa na yeli na nzewele? Ayo ija mkulu wake komwika yalolese wasang'hanaji wayagwe, na yawagwee ndiya mna isaa inogile. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Kamweda msang'hanaji ija mkulu wake yahabwela komvika kosang'hana vivo! <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Nowalongela ukweli, mkulu wake komwika msang'hanaji ayo yawe mulolesaji wa vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Lakini msang'hanaji ija yahailongela mwenyego, ‘Mkulu wangu kokawa ng'hani kubwela.’ Baho kosonga kuwatowa wasang'hanaji wayagwe, wa kitwanzi na wa kimbigalo, kuno koja na kung'wa mbaka kokoligwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Abaho mkulu wake kobwela mna isiku msang'hanaji ija haigesile na mna isaa haijuwile bule. Mkulu ayo komtowa ng'hani na kumwika hamoja na wanhu hawatogola.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>“Msang'hanaji ija yajuwile kija kiyolonda mkulu wake yakisang'hane, lakini hakisang'hana bule msang'hanaji ayo kotowigwa ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Lakini msang'hanaji ija hakijuwile kiyolonda mkulu wake, abaho kotenda kinhu kihile, msang'hanaji ayo kotowigwa kidogo. Munhu yagweleligwe vingi kodaigwa vingi, na munhu yagweleligwe vingi ng'hani kodaigwa vingi ng'hani.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatenda wanhu waigole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Niza kubwinha moto mwiisi, vinondile niye wahakile mwaka! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Nina ubatizo nolondigwa niubokele, na niye nougaiya ng'hani mbaka umale! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Vino mweye mogesa niza kugala tindiwalo mwiisi? Bule! Sizile kugala tindiwalo, lakini kuwagola wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Kulawa sambi, wanhu watano wa ng'anda imoja oigola, wadatu kwa wabili, na wabili kwa wadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Tata koigola na mwanage, na mwana koigola na tatake. Mama koigola na mndele wake, na mndele koigola na mamake. Mama mkwe koigola na mkwe wake wa kitwanzi, na mkwe wa kitwanzi koigola na mama mkwe wake.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujuwa vipindi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayo 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yesu kawalongela wanhu kabili, “Mwahajona wingu dolawilila mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa, baho molonga, ‘Mvula kotowa,’ na kweli kotowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Na mwahajona beho da kusini nyukwanyukwa molonga, ‘Hokuwa na vuke,’ na yokuwa vivo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Mweye mwa watapitapi! Modaha kulola isi na ulanga na kulagula kamba mvula kotowa hebu hatowa, habali hamujuwile fambulo da kipindi kino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ilumbe na munhu yakwihile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayo 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Habali hamudaha kujuwa wenyego mbuli zinogile za kusang'hana? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Kamba munhu kokugala mkitala, vinoga uilumbe nayo mung'hali mnzila. Wahalemelwa, kokugala kwa msemi, nayo msemi kokugala mmakono ga wakalizi, nao okugodeka mkifungo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Nokulongela, mumo humulawa ng'o, mbaka ulihe sente yose!”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Lekeni nzambi buleavo mofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Kipindi kikija wanhu wayagwe wakala aho, wamulongela Yesu mbuli ya Wagalilaya wakomigwe na Pilato kipindi viwakalile omulavila nhosa Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino mogesa Wagalilaya awo wakala na nzambi nyingi kubanza Wagalilaya wayagwe lekaavo wadununzika vivo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Bule! Nowalongela kweli, na mweye vivija mwahalema kuleka nzambi zenu, mose mofa kamba awo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Hebu mogesa wanhu waja longo na wanane wafile kwa kulagaliligwa na lingo ako Siloamu wakala na nzambi nyingi kubanza wanhu wose kudibuga da Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Bule! Nowalongela, mwahalema kuleka nzambi, mose mofa kamba awo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa biki hodilelaga matunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Munhu imoja kahanda biki da matunda mumgunda wake wa mizabibu. Kachola kuzahila matunda, lakini hapatile tunda jojose bule. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Avo kamulongela msang'hanaji wake, ‘Lola, mwaka uno wa kadatu nokwiza hano kuzahila matunda mdibiki dino, lakini sipata chochose. Udikanhe! Habali digendelele kuibananga isi?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Lakini msang'hanaji wake kamwidika, ‘Go mkulu, dileke mwaka uno wiiyeka, nodihalilila na kudikila mbolea. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Abaho kamba dahalela vinoga, lakini dahaleka kulela, kodaha kudikanha!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mtwanzi siku ya Kubwihila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Siku dimoja da Kubwihila, Yesu kakala yofundiza mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Baho kukala na mtwanzi imoja. Mtwanzi ayo kakala na kinyamkela yamtendile yalumwe miyaka longo na nane. Kakala yaveduke mgongo na hadahile kuigolosa bule. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu viyamone, kamkema, kamulongela, “Mama, kuhonyigwa utamu wako!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Yesu kamwikila makono, bahaja lukuli lwake lugoloka, nayo kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Lakini mkulu wa ng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu kagevuzika kwavija Yesu kamuhonya munhu mwiisiku ya Kubwihila. Avo kawalongela wanhu, “Mnazo siku sita za kusang'hana. Mzisiku azo, mwize muhonyigwe, lakini sikumwize kudisiku da Kubwihila!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Mndewa kamwidika, “Mweye mwa watapitapi! Vino, nani kumwenu yoleka kumfungula ng'ombe wake hebu kihongwe wake kulawa mdizizi na kumulongoza yachole kung'wa mazi mwiisiku ya Kubwihila? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Mtwanzi ino kolawa mulukolo lwa Abulahamu. Nayo kakala yagogigwe na Mwenembago kwa miyaka longo na nane. Vino halondeke kulekesigwa mwiisiku ya Kubwihila?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Mbuli azo ziyalongile Yesu ziwatenda waja wamwihile wagwe kinyala, lakini wanhu wayagwe wakala odeng'helela kwa mbuli zose za unzonza ziyasang'hane Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbeyu ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza, “Vino Undewa wa Imulungu uigala na choni? Vino niusimulile kwa lusimo gani? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yasolile mbeyu ndodo ya haladali na kuihanda mumgunda wake. Mbeyu ayo yota na kuwa biki kulu, na ndege wazenga mvulu zao mna gamatambi gake.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa hamila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayo 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yesu kawauza kabili, “Vino Undewa wa Imulungu uigala na choni? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Uigala na kija kilawilile kwa mtwanzi yasolile hamila na kuitibwiliza hamoja na madebe mabili ga usage, abaho usage wose ugongomoka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mulango msisili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayo 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu kagendelela na mwanza wake kuchola Yelusalemu, kubitila kuna gamabuga na vijiji kowapetela wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Munhu imoja kamuuza, “Go mkulu, vino onda wakomboligwe wanhu wadodo waiyeka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu kawedika, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Gangamaleni mwingile kubitila ulwivi msisili, kwavija wanhu wengi olonda kwingila lakini honda wadahe bule. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Mwene ng'anda kokwinuka na kuhinda ulwivi. Mweye mokwima kunze na kusonga kugong'onda ulwivi molonga, ‘Mndewa, tuvugulile!’ Nayo kowedika, ‘Sikujuwile kumulawa!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Mweye momwidika, ‘Tuja na kung'wa hamoja na gweye, na gweye kutufundiza kudibuga jetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Lakini heyo kolonga kabili, ‘Sikujuwile kumulawa! Segeleni kumwangu, mweye mose mutenda nzambi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Baho molila na kudafuna meno mwahawona Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo na watula ndagu wose wa Imulungu muundewa wa Imulungu, kuno mweye wenyego mwasigwa kunze! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Wanhu okwiza kulawa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa na mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa, kulawa mwambu wa kasikazini na mwambu wa kusini, okala hasi hana indiya muundewa wa Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Abaho wanhu waja weli wa ikimambukizo sambi okuwa wa ichanduso, na waja weli wa ichanduso sambi okuwa wa ikimambukizo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koinogela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Kipindi kikija Mafalisayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, “Segela hanhu hano uchole hanhu hayagwe, kwavija Helode kolonda kukukoma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesu kawedika, “Gendeni mkamulongele vino ija kizongo, ‘Nolava vinyamkela na kuhonya watamu lelo na mayo, na siku da kadatu nomambukiza sang'hano yangu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Hata avo lelo, mayo, na kisindo nogendelela na mwanza wangu, kwavija hailondigwa mtula ndagu wa Imulungu yafile kunze ya buga da Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Gweye Yelusalemu! Gweye Yelusalemu! Kowakoma watula ndagu wa Imulungu na kuwatowa kwa mabwe waja Imulungu yawatumile kumwako! Miyanza mingapi nilonda kuwahagata wanago kwa makono gangu, kamba vija nguku viyovihagata vinziya vake mna gamabawa gake, lakini hulondile bule! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Sambi lola, Ng'anda yenu ya Imulungu ilekigwa vihame! Na niye nowalongela, hondamumbone kabili mbaka siku dija vondamulonge, ‘Imulungu yamtambikile ija yokwiza kwa twaga da Mndewa!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu mtamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Mwiisiku imoja ya Kubwihila, Yesu kachola kuja ndiya mng'anda ya mkulu imoja wa Mafalisayo, wanhu wakala omulola goya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Munhu imoja yakalile na utamu wa kuvimba lukuli keza kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu kawauza wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, “Vino, vinoga kumuhonya munhu mwiisiku ya Kubwihila hebu havinogile bule?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Lakini wao hawalongile mbuli yoyose bule. Yesu kamsola mtamu ija, kamuhonya, abaho kamuleka yachole. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Abaho kawauza, “Vino nani kumwenu yeli na mwana hebu ng'ombe, yahadumbukila mdikolombo mwiisiku ya Kubwihila, hamulava mwiisiku ayo?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Lakini wao hawadahile kumwidika mbuli ino.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uhole na moyo unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesu kawona wanhu waja wagonekigwe viwakalile osagula vigoda va kuulongozi. Avo kawalongela wose lusimo luno, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Munhu yahakugoneka kuna idizengele, sikuukale mvigoda va haulongozi, kwavija kodaha kwiza munhu yagonekigwe yeli munhu mkulu kubanza gweye, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>na munhu yawagoneke mose wabili kokwizila na kukulongela, ‘Segela aho haukalile umulekele miyago.’ Baho kogwa kinyala mgameso ga wanhu na kobwela kukala kuvigoda va kuchugu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Lakini wahagonekigwa kuna indiya, genda ukakale kuvigoda va kuchugu, ili munhu yakugoneke yaheza yakulongele, ‘Mbwigangu, izo ukale kuvigoda va haulongozi.’ Baho kopata nhogolwa mgameso ga wanhu wose wagonekigwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Kwavija waja wose oitenda wenyego wanhu wakulu otendigwa wanhu wadodo, na waja oitenda wenyego wanhu wadodo otendigwa wanhu wakulu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela ija yamgoneke, “Kamba kowatanda wanhu ndiya ya imisi hebu ya ichungulo, sikuuwagoneke mbwiga zako, hebu ndugu zako, hebu matajili hebu wanhu weli behi na gweye. Kwavija wahatenda vivo, na hewo nao okugoneka na avo okuliha vija viuwatendele hewo. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Lakini kamba wahatenda nyimwilinyimwili, wagoneke wakiwa,, mbetembete, waholole, na waja wasuwameso, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>na gweye kotambikiligwa, kwavija awo hawadaha kukuliha. Imulungu kokuliha mwiisiku ya kuzilibuligwa kwa wanhu wanogile.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa nyimwilinyimwili ng'hulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayo 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Munhu imoja mna iwaja wakalile hana indiya viyahulike avo, kamulongela Yesu, “Wamweda waja onda waje ndiya ya nyimwilinyimwili muundewa wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Munhu imoja katenda nyimwilinyimwili ng'hulu, kawagoneka wanhu wengi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Viivikile saa ya nyimwilinyimwili, kamtuma msang'hanaji wake yakawalongele wanhu wagonekigwe weze, kwavija kila kinhu kitandigwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Lakini kila munhu kalava kitala chake. Munhu wa ichanduso kamulongela msang'hanaji ija, ‘Nigula mgunda, avo nolondigwa nikaulole. Chonde, ndeka nyhole.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Iyagwe kalonga, ‘Nigula ng'ombe longo wa kulimila, avo vino na muumwanza, nochola kuwageza. Chonde, ndeka nyhole.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Iyagwe kalonga, ‘Sambi sambi nisola mwehe, avo sidaha kwiza.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>“Msang'hanaji ija kabwela na kumulongela mbuli zose zino mkulu wake. Mkulu wake kagevuzika ng'hani, kamulongela msang'hanaji wake, ‘Lopola ugende mzinzila mhanda na mna gamabuga, uwagale hano wanhu wakiwa, waholole, wasuwameso na mbetembete.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Bahaja msang'hanaji ija kamulongela, ‘Go mkulu, gago gose gasang'hanigwa, lakini kuna gati disigala.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Avo mkulu ija kamulongela msang'hanaji wake, ‘Lawa kunze uchole mzinzila na mna gamakulugumbi ukawalongele wanhu weze, ili ng'anda yangu imeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Nowalongela kweli, kuduhu hata munhu imoja mna iwaja wagonekigwe walemile kwiza yonda yalanze ndiya yangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kudununzika sama ya kuwa mwanahina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayo 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Baho lunhu lwa wanhu vilukalile lomkweleleza, Yesu kahinduka, kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Munhu yoyose yokwiza kumwangu na kuno kowanogela ng'hani tatake na mamake na mwehe wake na wanage na lumbu zake na ndugu zake na vivija kamba kounogela ng'hani ugima wake mwenyego kubanza kumnogela Kilisito, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Na munhu yoyose haupapa msalaba wake na kunikweleleza, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>“Vino nani kumwenu yahalonda kuzenga lingo, tanhu hakala hasi na kugelegeza sente za kudizengela, ili yajuwe kamba kana sente za kumambukiza sang'hano yake? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Buleavo, yahamambukiza kuzenga chandusilo, kolemelwa kumambukiza kuzenga dilingo, na wose wachone acho kilawilile omseka, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>olonga, ‘Munhu ino kasonga kuzenga, lakini kalemelwa kumambukiza sang'hano yake!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>“Hebu mndewa gani yahaitanda kuchola kuitowa na mndewa iyagwe, tanhu hakala hasi na kugelegeza kamba heyo na wakalizi zake elufu kumi kodaha kuitowa na mndewa miyage yeli na wakalizi elufu ishilini? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Kamba yahona hadaha, kowatuma wasenga zake wakaiting'hane na mndewa iyagwe, wampule wailumbe yang'hali kutali.” <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Yesu kamambukiza kulonga, “Vivo ili kumwenu, kuduhu munhu yodaha kuwa mwanahina wangu mbaka yaleke kila kinhu kiyali nacho.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkele ubanangike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Mkele unoga, lakini wahagiza ukali wake, kuduhu nzila ya kuubweza kabili. <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Haufaya kwa isi hebu mna imbolea, lakini okwasigwa. Yeli na magwiti yahulike!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa ng'hondolo yapotele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Siku dimoja wabokela kodi wengi na wanhu wayagwe otenda nzambi wachola kumtegeleza Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wasonga kunung'unika, “Munhu ino kowabokela wanhu otenda nzambi na kuja nao!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Avo Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno.<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Vino kamba imoja wenu kana ng'hondolo gana, abaho ng'hondolo imoja kapotela, vino kotenda choni? Kowaleka waja malongo tisa na tisa kuluwala, na kuchola kumzahila ija yapotele mbaka yampate. <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Yahampata, kodeng'helela na kumwika mmaega gake, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>na kumgala ukae. Abaho kowakema hamoja mbwiga zake na wanhu weli behi nayo na kowalongela, ‘Miyenu nodeng'helela kwavija nimpata ng'hondolo wangu yapotele. Avo tudeng'helele hamoja!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Nowalongela, avo vonda iwe, hokuwa na ndeng'helelo ng'hulu kuulanga mbuli ya munhu imoja mwene nzambi yahaleka nzambi zake, kubanza waja malongo tisa na tisa ogesa wanoga na hawalonda kuzileka nzambi zao.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa sente ipotele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Hebu mtwanzi yeli na sente longo yahagiza imoja, kotendaze? Kobwinha taa, kofagila ng'anda yake, na kulola goya kila hanhu mbaka yaipate. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Yahaipata, kowakema hamoja mbwiga zake na wanhu weli behi yake, kowalongela, ‘Nodeng'helela ng'hani kwavija niipata sente yangu ipotele. Avo tudeng'helele hamoja!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Vivija nowalongela, wasenga wa Imulungu odeng'helela mbuli ya munhu imoja mwene nzambi yahaleka nzambi zake.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mwana yapotele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Kukala na munhu imoja yakalile na wana wabili. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Ija imdodo kamulongela tatake, ‘Tata, nigwelele uhazi wangu sambi.’ Avo munhu ija kawagolela uhazi wao wanage awo wabili. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Hazibitile siku nyingi, ija imdodo kachuuza uhazi wake. Abaho kafunga mwanza na sente ziyapatile, kachola isi ya kutali, ako kazinanga sente zose ziyapatile. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Kamambukiza kila kinhu kiyakalile nacho. Abaho lufilili lwa nzala lulawilila mwiisi ija, nayo kakala kabule kinhu chochose kisigale. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Avo kachola kusang'hana kibaluwa kwa munhu imoja wa isi ija, munhu ayo kamtuma mumgunda wake yasusile nguluwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Kakala kosulukila kuja maganda gawadile nguluwe, lakini kuduhu munhu yamgwelele kinhu chochose chakuja. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Abaho kagelegeza na kulonga, ‘Tatangu kana wasang'hanaji wengi, oja mbaka osigaza na niye hano nofa na nzala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Nosegela na kuchola kwa tatangu na kumulongela, Tata, nimtenda Imulungu nzambi, na vivija nikutendela gweye nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Sifaya kukemigwa mwanago. Nhende kamba imoja wa wasang'hanaji zako.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Avo kafunga mwanza wa kubwela kwa tatake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Viyakalile yang'hali kutali, tatake kamona. Kamonela bazi mwanage, avo kamkimbilila, kamuhagatila na kamnonela. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Mwanage kamulongela, ‘Tata, nimtenda Imulungu nzambi, na vivija nikutendela gweye. Sifaya kukemigwa mwanago.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Lakini tatake kawakema wasang'hanaji zake. Kawalongela, ‘Lopoleni! Galeni kiwalo kinogile mumvaze. Mvazeni pete mkidole chake na vilatu mmagulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Abaho choleni mdigale bofu da ng'ombe dinonile mudichinje, wose tuje na kudeng'helela! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Kwavija mwanangu ino kakala yafile lakini sambi mgima. Kakala yapotele lakini sambi koneka.’ Avo wasonga kudeng'helela.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Kipindi acho mwanage imkulu kakala kumgunda. Viyakalile behi na ing'anda, kahulika nyila na wanhu ocheza. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Avo kamkema msang'hanaji imoja, kamuuza, ‘Ako kuna choni?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Msang'hanaji ayo kamwidika, ‘Mdodo wako kabwela ukae, na tatako kamchinjila bofu da ng'ombe dinonile, kwavija kabwela mgima!’<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>“Ija imwana mkulu kagevuzika ng'hani, avo kalema kwingila mng'anda. Tatake kalawa kunze na kumpula yengile mng'anda. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Lakini kamwidika tatake, ‘Lola, miyaka yose ino niye nokusang'hanila kamba msang'hanaji, na silemile lagizo jako jojose. Kungwaa choni? Hunigwelele hata mbuzi nideng'helele na mbwiga zangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Lakini mwanago ino kananga vinhu vako mbuli ya ugoni, na viyabwelile ukae kumchinjila bofu da ng'ombe dinonile!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Tatake kamwidika, ‘Mwanangu, kipindi chose kukala na niye, na vinhu vose vinilinavo vako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Lakini tolondigwa tudeng'helele na kusekelela, kwavija mdodo wako kakala yafile lakini sambi mgima, kakala yapotele lakini sambi koneka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mulolesaji mbala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Kukala na tajili imoja yakalile na mulolesaji wa vinhu vake. Tajili ayo kalongeligwa kamba mulolesaji ayo konanga sente zake. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Avo kamkema mng'anda, kamuuza, ‘Mbuli gani zimhulika kumwako? Mhetela vinhu vose viubokele na vija viulavile, kwavija hudaha kuwa mulolesaji wa vinhu vangu kabili.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Mulolesaji ija kailongela, ‘Mkulu wangu konilekesa sang'hano. Notenda choni? Kulima sidahile bule, na kupula nokona kinyala. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Sambi nojuwa choni chonda nhende ili nahalavigwa mna isang'hano, niwe na mbwiga wa kunibokela mzikae zao!’<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>“Avo kawakema wanhu wose wakalile odaigwa na mkulu wake. Kamuuza wa ichanduso, ‘Kodaigwa choni na mkulu wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Nayo kamwidika, ‘Madebe gana gamavuta.’ Mulolesaji ija kamulongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, kala hasi, lopola wandike malongo matano.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Abaho kamuuza iyagwe, ‘Na gweye kodaigwa choni?’ Nayo kamwidika, ‘Viloba gana va ngano.’ Mulolesaji ija kamulongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, wandike malongo nane.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>“Mkulu wa ija mulolesaji mbala kamtogola kwavija katenda vinhu kwa ubala. Kwavija wanhu wa mwiisi ino wabala ng'hani mna zimbuli zao kubanza wanhu wa kumulenge.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Avo nowalongeleni, itendeleni umbwiga kubitila vinhu va mwiisi, ili vahamala mudahe kubokeligwa kuna ikae ya ugima wa milele. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Munhu yoyose yotamaniligwa mna ivinhu vidodo, kotamaniligwa mna ivinhu vikulu. Na munhu yoyose hatamaniligwa mna ivinhu vidodo, vivija hatamaniligwa mna ivinhu vikulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Avo kamba mweye hamutamaniligwa kulolesa mali za mwiisi, modahaze kutamaniligwa kulolesa mali za kuulanga? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Na kamba hutamaniligwa kulolesa vinhu va munhu iyagwe, nani yonda yakugwee vinhu vako mwenyego?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Kuduhu msang'hanaji yodaha kuwasang'hanila wakulu wabili. Kwavija komwihila imoja na kumnogela iyagwe, hebu koilumba na imoja na kumbeza iyagwe. Hamudaha kumsang'hanila Imulungu hamoja na mali.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi uyagwe wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Mafalisayo viwazihulike mbuli zino zose, wamzeha Yesu, kwavija wakala onogelwa na sente. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye awo wanhu muitenda munoga mgameso ga wanhu, lakini Imulungu kaijuwa mizoyo yenu. Kwavija vinhu vikoneka vinoga ng'hani kwa wanhu, mgameso ga Imulungu vokoneka viha.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Malagizo ga Musa na maandiko ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu vikala vipetigwa mbaka kipindi cha Yohana Mbatizaji. Kusongela aho, Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Imulungu yopetigwa, na kila munhu kowamba kokwingila. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Lakini vibuha ng'hani kwa ulanga na isi kupotela, kubanza kinhu kidodo ng'hani kupotela mna Gamalagizo.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Mbigalo yoyose yomwasa mwehe wake na kusola mtwanzi iyagwe, kotenda ugoni. Na mbigalo yomsola mtwanzi ija yasigwe, nayo kotenda ugoni vivija.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu tajili na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Kukala na tajili imoja yavalile viwalo va sente nyingi ng'hani na kuja goya kila siku. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Vivija kukala na munhu imoja mkiwa yakemigwe Lazalo, kamema vilonda lukuli lose, kakala yokwikigwa muulwivi lwa tajili ija. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Lazalo kakala yosulukila kuja vilagale muimeza ya tajili ayo. Na umbwa wakala okwiza na kumulambita mvilonda vake.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>“Abaho mkiwa ija kafa na kasoligwa na wasenga wa kuulanga mbaka behi ya Abulahamu. Tajili ayo nayo kafa na kazikigwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Ako kowochola wanhu wafile, kakala kodununzika ng'hani. Kenula meso gake, kamona Abulahamu kwa kutali na Lazalo kakala behi yake. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Avo kamkema kwa sauti ng'hulu, ‘Tata Abulahamu! Nyonele bazi! Mtume Lazalo yazabike kidole chake mgamazi, yaluhoze lulimi lwangu, kwavija nogaya ng'hani muumoto uno!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>“Lakini Abulahamu kamulongela, ‘Mwanangu, kumbuka muugima wako kubokela vinhu vinogile, nayo Lazalo kabokela vihile. Lakini sambi Lazalo kobwihila, na gweye kodununzika. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Hata avo, hagati yetu siye na mweye hekigwa kolombo kulu, ili munhu yolonda kuloka kulawa kuno kwiza kumwenu sikuyadahe, hebu munhu yoyose kulawa kumwenu sikuyaloke kwiza kumwetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Tajili ija kalonga, ‘Nokupula gweye, tata Abulahamu, umtume Lazalo kuna ikae ya tatangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>ako kuna ndugu zangu watano. Muleke yachole yakawazume ili sikuweze hanhu hano ha kudununzika!’<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>“Abulahamu kalonga, ‘Ndugu zako wanago maandiko ga Musa na ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu ga kuwazuma. Wawategeleze wao kiwolonga!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Tajili ija kamwidika, ‘Bule tata Abulahamu! Lakini kamba munhu yahazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile na kuwacholela, baho ozileka nzambi zao!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Lakini Abulahamu kamulongela, ‘Kamba hawagagoga maandiko ga Musa na watula ndagu wa Imulungu, honda wategeleze hata kamba munhu yahazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayo 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maluko 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Vinhu vonda viwatende wanhu watende nzambi volawilila, lakini kogaya munhu ija yovitenda vilawilile! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Yokuwa vinoga kwa munhu ayo yagodekigwe dibwe kulu da kudugila msingo na yasigwe mbahali, kubanza kumuhonza imoja wa wadodo wano yatende nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Avo iteganyeni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Ndugu yako yahakutendela nzambi, umzume. Yahatogola, gela kumgongo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Yahakutendela nzambi miyanza saba kwa siku dimoja, na kila yaheza kumwako kolonga, ‘Ng'hosa,’ kolondigwa ugele kumgongo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tamanilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Watumigwa wamulongela Mndewa, “Twengezele tamanilo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Mndewa kawedika, “Maza tamanilo jenu dahakuwile kulu kamba mbeyu ndodo ya haladali, mwahadahile kudilongela biki dino da mkuyu, ‘Ng'oka ukaihande mbahali!’ najo dahawatogolele.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya msang'hanaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Vino nani kumwenu yeli na msang'hanaji yomulimila hebu kosusila ng'hondolo, yahabwela kumgunda, komulongela yalopole kuja ndiya yake? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Bule. Lakini komulongela, ‘Uitande, nitandile ndiya yangu, unisang'hanile mbaka ng'homeleze kuja na kung'wa, abaho na gweye koja na kung'wa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Vino komgwaa nhogolwa msang'hanaji ayo kwavija kasang'hana gaja galagilizigwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Vivo ili kumwenu mweye, mwahatenda vose vimulagilizigwe, longeni, ‘Siye twa wasang'hanaji wadodo, tusang'hana kija kitulondigwe kusang'hana!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu longo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesu viyakalile mnzila kochola Yelusalemu, kabitila mzimbaka za vijiji va Samalia na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Viyakalile kokwingila mna ikijiji kimoja, mumo kukala na wanhu longo wakalile na utamu wa dikulu, wemile kutali. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Waguta, “Go mkulu! Yesu! Tonele bazi!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesu kawona, kawalongela, “Gendeni mkailaguse kwa walava nhosa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Viwakalile mnzila ochola, wahona. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Imoja wao viyone kahona, kabweleganya kwa Yesu kuno komgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu kwa sauti ng'hulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Kamgwila Yesu mmagulu kingubanguba, kamtogola. Munhu ayo kakala Msamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesu kalonga, “Vino hawakalile wanhu longo wahonyigwe? Wayagwe tisa wa kwahi? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Vino kuduhu iyagwe yabwelile kumgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, ila munhu ino hali muyahudi?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela munhu ija, “Ima na uchole. Kutamanila kwako kukuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Undewa wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamuuza Yesu Undewa wa Imulungu vonda wize. Yesu kawedika, “Undewa wa Imulungu hawiza kwa kukoneka kwa meso. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Kuduhu munhu yonda yalonge, ‘Lola, uno hano!’ hebu ‘Uja haja!’ Kwavija Undewa wa Imulungu wa mgati mmwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Abaho kawalongela wanahina zake, “Kipindi chokwiza vonda mulonde kuyona siku imoja mwiizisiku za Mwana wa Munhu, lakini hondamuyone bule. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Baho wanhu owalongela, ‘Loleni kakuja!’ hebu ‘Loleni, kahano!’ Sikumuwakweleleze. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Kwavija kamba vija lumwesa vilulawilila kuulanga na kumwemwesa kulawa mwambu umoja mbaka mwambu uyagwe, vivo vonda yawe Mwana wa Munhu mwiisiku yake. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Lakini tanhu kolondigwa yadununzike ng'hani na kulemigwa na wanhu wa lukolo luno. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Kamba viikalile mna ikipindi cha Nuhu, vivo vonda iwe mzisiku za Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Kila munhu kakala koja na kung'wa, kusola na kusoligwa mbaka siku ija Nuhu viyengile mdisafina. Mvula ng'hulu itowa na kuwakoma wanhu wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Vivija kamba viilawilile mna ikipindi cha Lutu. Wanhu wagendelela kuja na kung'wa, kugula na kuchuuza, kuhanda na kusenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Lakini siku ija Lutu viyasegele Sodoma, moto na mabwe gokwaka vilagala hasi na kuwakoma wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Vivo vonda iwe mwiisiku Mwana wa Munhu vonda yagubuligwe.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Mwiisiku ayo, munhu yeli mkiswili cha ng'anda yake sikuyahumuluke mng'anda kusola vinhu vake, vivija munhu yeli kumgunda sikuyabwele ukae. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Kumbukeni gampatile mwehe wake Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Munhu yoyose yolonda kuukombola ugima wake mwenyego, kowagiza, na yoyose yowagiza ugima wake, koukombola. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Nowalongela, kilo acho wanhu wabili wawasile mulusazi lumoja, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Watwanzi wabili oduga sembe hamoja, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Wanhu wabili okuwa kumgunda, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza, “Vino, kwahi Mndewa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu kawedika, “Kokose kuli na mzoga, baho honda waiting'hane mhungu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mgane na msemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Abaho Yesu kawafundiza wanahina zake kwa lusimo kamba siku zose olondigwa kumpula Imulungu na sikuwadonhe. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Kalonga, “Kudibuga dimoja kukala na msemi yakalile hamdumba Imulungu hebu kuwatonga wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Vivija kudibuga dijo, kukala na mgane imoja yakalile komgendela msemi ayo baho kwa baho, kampula, ‘Ngwelele haki yangu kulawa kwa munhu yanitendele gehile.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Siku nyingi msemi ayo hamtegeleze mgane ayo, lakini kumwande kailongela, ‘Hata kamba simdumba Imulungu hebu kuwatonga wanhu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>lakini kwavija mgane ino konigaza, nomgwaa haki yake, kwavija nahaleka, kogendelela kwiza hano na kunigaza!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Abaho Mndewa kagendelela kulonga, “Tegelezeni kiyalongile msemi ija yehile. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Vino, Imulungu honda yawagwee haki wanhu zake yawasagule, omulilila imisi na ikilo? Vino kokawa kuwategeleza? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Nowalongela, kowagwaa haki yao himahima. Lakini Mwana wa Munhu vonda yeze, vino kodivika tamanilo mwiisi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa Mfalisayo na mbokela kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno wanhu waja wakalile oitapa wanoga na kuwabeza wayagwe. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Kukala na wanhu wabili wacholile kumpula Imulungu kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu. Imoja kakala Mfalisayo na iyagwe kakala mbokela kodi.<verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>“Mfalisayo ayo kainega kumgwazo na kumpula Imulungu, ‘Go Imulungu, nokugwaa nhogolwa kwavija niye sili kamba wanhu wayagwe, wabokaji, otenda gehile, hebu wagoni. Wala sili kamba ino mbokela kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Niye nofunga kuja miyanza mibili mzisiku saba, na nolava fungu da longo da vinhu vangu vose vinipata!’<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>“Lakini ija mbokela kodi kema kutali, hadahile hata kwinula meso gake kuulanga, lakini kaitowa mhambaga yake kwa usungu, kalonga, ‘Go Imulungu, nyonele bazi, niye na mwene nzambi!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Nowalongela, mbokela kodi ija kachola ukae kumwake kuno katendigwa kanoga mgameso ga Imulungu kubanza ija Mfalisayo. Kwavija wose oitenda wanhu wakulu ohumulusigwa, na waja oihumulusa otendigwa wanhu wakulu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatambikila wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu wana wadodo yawekile makono. Wanahina viwone avo, wawakomhokela. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Lakini Yesu kawakema iwana, kalonga, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu, sikumuwagomese, kwavija Undewa wa Imulungu wa wanhu kamba wano. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli! Munhu yoyose yolema kuubokela Undewa wa Imulungu kamba mwana mdodo, honda yengile ng'o!”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu tajili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Mkulu imoja kamuuza Yesu, “Mfundiza Unogile, nhende choni niupate ugima wa milele?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Habali kong'hema, ‘unogile’? Kuduhu yanogile, ila Imulungu yaiyeka. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Kugajuwa Malagizo, ‘Sikuutende ugoni, sikuukome, sikuwibe, sikuulonge uvizi, wategeleze tatako na mamako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Munhu ija kedika, “Gago gose nigagoga toka haudodo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu viyahulike avo, kamulongela, “Kuhungukiligwa na kinhu kimoja. Chuuza vose viulinavo, uwagwee sente wanhu wakiwa, na gweye kokuwa na ngama yako kuulanga. Abaho wize unikweleleze.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Lakini munhu ayo viyahulike avo, kanyunyuwala kwavija kakala tajili ng'hani.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu viyamone kanyunyuwala, kalonga, “Vino avo vonda iwe vidala kwa wanhu matajili kwingila Muundewa wa Imulungu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Kwavija vibuha kwa ngamiya kubita mna ikizonzo cha sanzia, kubanza tajili kwingila muundewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Wanhu wamuhulike, wamuuza, “Avo lelo nani yonda yadahe kukomboligwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vinhu havidahika kwa wanhu, kwa Imulungu vodahika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Abaho Petulo kalonga, “Lola! Siye tuvileka vinhu vetu vose, tukukweleleza gweye.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yoleka kae yake hebu mwehe wake hebu ndugu zake hebu tatake na mamake hebu wanage mbuli ya Undewa wa Imulungu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>kobokela vinhu vingi ng'hani mna ikipindi kino na kobokela ugima wa milele mna ikipindi chonda kize.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwa kadatu mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu kawagala hamgwazo wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawalongela, “Tegelezeni! Tochola Yelusalemu. Kuko kila kinhu chandikigwe na watula ndagu wa Imulungu mbuli ya Mwana wa Munhu cholawilila. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Kwavija kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu haweli Wayahudi, nao omzeha, omuliga, na omtemela mate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Omtowa mbalati na kumkoma, lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Lakini wanahina hawazijuwile bule mbuli azo, kwavija wakala wafisigwe na hawakijuwile kija kiyakalile yokilonga Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msuwameso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesu viyakalile behi na kuvika Yeliko, munhu imoja yakalile msuwameso kakala hamgwazo mnzila, kopula. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Munhu ayo viyahulike lunhu lwa wanhu lobita, kauza, “Kuna choni?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Wanhu wamulongela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti kobita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Nayo kakemelela, “Yesu! Mwana wa Daudi! Nyonele bazi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Wanhu walongole wamkomhokela, wamulongela yanyamale. Lakini heyo kagendelela kukemelela ng'hani, “Mwana wa Daudi! Nyonele bazi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Avo Yesu kema, kalagiza munhu ija yagaligwe kumwake. Viyavikile behi, Yesu kamuuza, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Kolonda nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Nayo kamwidika, “Go mkulu, nolonda kulola.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lola! Kutamanila kwako kukuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Bahaja munhu ija kadaha kulola, kamkweleleza Yesu kuno komgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu. Wanhu wose viwone avo, wamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesu kachola kudibuga da Yeliko, na kakala yobita mzinzila za buga dijo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Kuko kukala na mkulu imoja wa wabokela kodi yakemigwe Zakayo, nayo kakala tajili. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Kakala kolonda kumona Yesu, lakini hadahile mbuli ya lunhu lwa wanhu na kwavija kakala mguhi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Avo kakimbila haulongozi wa lunhu luja, kakwela mdibiki da mkuyu ili yamone Yesu, yakalile yochola kubitila nzila ija. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesu viyavikile hanhu aho, kalola uchanha, kamulongela, “Zakayo, himahima humuluka hasi, kwavija lelo nolondigwa kukala mng'anda yako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zakayo kahumuluka himahima, kamgoneka Yesu kwa kudeng'helela. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Wanhu wose wagone ago, wasonga kunung'unika, walonga, “Munhu ino kachola kukala mng'anda ya munhu mwene nzambi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zakayo kema, kamulongela Yesu, “Go Mkulu, tegeleza! Nowagwaa wakiwa nusu ya vinhu vangu, na kamba nimboka munhu yoyose kinhu, nombwezela miyanza mine.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lelo ukombola uvika kwa wanhu wa lubuga luno, kwavija munhu ino na heyo kolawa mulukolo lwa Abulahamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu keza kuwazahila na kuwakombola waja wapotele.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa wasang'hanaji longo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Wanhu viwakalile otegeleza gago, Yesu kagendelela kuwalongela lusimo. Baho kakala mmabehi na Yelusalemu, nao wagesa kamba Undewa wa Imulungu wammabehi kulawilila. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Avo kawalongela, “Kukala na munhu imoja wa lukolo lwa kindewa yafungile mwanza kuchola isi ya kutali yakatendigwe mndewa, abaho yabwele ukae kumwake. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Avo yang'hali hanasegela, kawakema wasang'hanaji zake longo, kila imoja kamgwaa sente sawa, abaho kawalongela, ‘Tendeni biyashala mbaka vondambwele.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Lakini wanhu wa isi yake wakala wamwihile. Avo wawatuma wasenga wagende kwa wanhu waja wakalonge, ‘Hatumulonda munhu ino yawe mndewa wetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Munhu ija kaupata undewa, kabwela ukae kumwake. Baho kawalagiza wasang'hanaji zake yawagwelele sente wachole kumwake yapate kujuwa kija kiwapatile. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Msang'hanaji wa ichanduso keza, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, sente zako ziunigwelele zilela miyanza longo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Kamulongela, ‘Kutenda goya msang'hanaji unogile! Kwavija kutenda vinogile kulolesa mna ivinhu vidodo, nokutenda uwe munhu mkulu wa mabuga longo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Msang'hanaji wa kabili keza, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, sente zako ziunigwelele zilela miyanza mitano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Nayo kamulongela, ‘Kokuwa munhu mkulu wa mabuga matano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>“Msang'hanaji iyagwe keza, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, sola sente zako. Nikala nizifungile goya mkikumbi. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Nikudumba, kwavija kuna gahigahi. Kosola vinhu va wayago kwa uvizi na kosenga vija huvihandile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Mkulu ija kamulongela, ‘Gweye kwa msang'hanaji yehile! Nokutagusa kwa mbuli zako mwenyego! Kunijuwa nina gahigahi, nisolaga vinhu va wayangu na kusenga vija sivihandile. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Habali huzikile sente zangu kwa wanhu okwika sente ili vimbwelile nyambulile zongezeke?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>“Abaho kawalongela waja wemile aho, ‘Mbokeni ayo zisente, mumgwelele msang'hanaji ija yapatile sente miyanza longo ya zija ziyagweleligwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Lakini wao wamulongela, ‘Go mkulu, lakini heyo kanazo sente miyanza longo!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Nayo kawedika, ‘Munhu yeli na kinhu kokongezelwa, lakini ija yeliduhu kinhu, kobokigwa hata kija kidodo kiyelinacho. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Na sambi, waja wanihile, ondema niye niwe mndewa wao, wagaleni hano, muwakome bahano mgameso gangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu kwa deng'ho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga avo, kawalongolela kuchola Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Viyakalile behi na kuvika Betifage na Betania, habehi na Lugongo lwa Mizeituni, kawatuma wanahina zake wabili, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>kawalongela, “Gendeni kuna ikijiji kili kuulongozi wenu. Mwahengila, momvika mwana wa kihongwe kafungigwa, nayo yang'hali hanakweligwa na munhu. Mfunguleni mumgale hano.<figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mwana wa kihongwe</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Munhu yoyose yahawauza habali momfungula, mulongeleni, ‘Mndewa komulonda.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Wanahina waja wachola, wamvika kamba vija Yesu viyawalongele. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Viwakalile omfungula imwana wa kihongwe, wenyego wawauza, “Habali momfungula?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Nao wawedika, “Mndewa komulonda.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Wamgala imwana wa kihongwe kwa Yesu. Abaho watandika viwalo vao mumgongo wa imwana wa kihongwe, na wamtaza Yesu kukwela. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Yesu viyakalile kochola, wanhu wanzanza viwalo vao mnzila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Viyakalile behi na kuvika Yelusalemu, hanhu hali na mtelemuko wa Lugongo lwa Mizeituni, lunhu mkulu lwa wanahina zake lusonga kudeng'helela na kumgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu kwa sauti ng'hulu mbuli ya unzonza wauwonile. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Walonga, “Imulungu yamtambikile Mndewa yokwiza kwa twaga da Imulungu, tindiwalo kuulanga na ukulu kwa Imulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Baho Mafalisayo wayagwe wakalile muulunhu wamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, walagize wanahina zako wanyamale!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongeleni, wahanyamala wano, mabwe goguta.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalilila wanhu wa buga da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yesu viyavikile behi na buga da Yelusalemu na viyawone wanhu wa buga dijo, kawalilila, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>kalonga, “Maza lelo mwahajuwile mbuli zilondigwa kugala tindiwalo! Lakini sambi zifisigwa mgameso genu! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Kwavija kipindi chokwiza, wanhu wakwihile vonda wakuzengele senyenge, okuzunguluka na kukusung'ha sung'ha kila mwambu. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Okuhondahonda gweye na wanhu zako weli muuluwa wako. Kuduhu hata dibwe dimoja donda disigazigwe uchanha ya diyagwe, kwavija hukijuwile kipindi kiyezile Imulungu kukukombola!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Mng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Abaho Yesu kengila Mng'anda ya Imulungu, kasonga kuwawinga wanhu wakalile ochuuza vinhu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>kawalongela, “Yandikigwa mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, Imulungu kalonga, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokuwa ng'anda ya kupulila.’ Lakini mweye muitenda mhango ya wabavi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Kila siku Yesu kakala kofundiza Mng'anda ya Imulungu. Wakulu wa walava nhosa, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, na vilongozi wa wanhu walonda kumkoma, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>lakini hawadahile bule kutenda avo, kwavija wanhu wose wakala omtegeleza goya, hawalondile kuswela mbuli.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Siku dimoja Yesu kakala Mng'anda ya Imulungu kowafundiza wanhu na kuwapetela Mbuli Inogile. Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa hamoja na wavele weza, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>wamulongela, “Tulongele, vino kotenda mbuli zino kwa udahi wa nani? Nani yakugwelele udahi uno?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Beteni na niye niwauze mbuli imoja. Nongeleni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>vino udahi wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa kuulanga hebu kwa wanhu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Wagesa, “Tulonge choni? Twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kuulanga,’ kotuuza, ‘Habali, hamumtogole Yohana?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Na twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’ lunhu lose luno lotutowa mabwe, kwavija wose otogola kamba Yohana kakala mtula ndagu wa Imulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Avo wamwidika, “Hatujuwile kuulawile.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Na niye siwalongela bule notenda mbuli zino kwa udahi wa nani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa walimaji mumgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanhu lusimo luno, “Kukala na munhu imoja yahandile mizabibu mumgunda wake. Kawakodisha walimaji, abaho kachola mwiisi iyagwe na kakala siku nyingi. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Msimu wa kubawa zabibu viuvikile, munhu ija kamtuma msang'hanaji wake yachole kwa walimaji wamgwelele zabibu. Lakini walimaji waja wamtowa msang'hanaji ija, wamuwinga makono gaiyeka. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Avo kamtuma msang'hanaji iyagwe, lakini walimaji wamtowa vivija na kumuliga, wamuwinga makono gaiyeka. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Abaho kamtuma msang'hanaji wa kadatu. Ino nayo walimaji wamulumiza, wamwasa kunze. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Abaho mwene mgunda ija kalonga, ‘Nhende choni? Nomtuma mwanangu nimnogele. Lamda ino omtegeleza!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Lakini walimaji viwamone, wailongela, ‘Ino ayo muhazi wake. Tumkome na uhazi wake okuwa wetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Avo wamulava kunze ya mgunda uja, wamkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu kawauza, “Vino, mwene mgunda kowatenda choni waja walimaji? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Kokwiza na kuwakoma walimaji wose awo na kowakodisha walimaji wayagwe mgunda awo wa mizabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Wanhu viwahulike mbuli ayo, walonga, “Bule! Sikuilawilile avo!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Lakini Yesu kawalola, kawauza, “Vino, ulonzi uno fambulo jake choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Dibwe wadilemile wazengaji kamba hadifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">digalamuka dibwe kulu da kutamanila kubanza gose!’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Munhu yoyose yonda yaikwale mdibwe ajo kobeneka beneka na munhu donda dimulagalile domuhonda tipitipi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wakulu wa walava nhosa wajuwa kamba lusimo ulo kakala kowafumbila wao. Avo bahaja walonda kumgoga Yesu, lakini wawadumba wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Avo wazahila kipindi kinogile. Wawahonga wanhu wayagwe waitende wanoga, wawatuma wamgeze Yesu kwa kumuuza, ili wadahe kumgoga na kumgala kwa mkulu wa Lumi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Wanhu awo wamulongela Yesu, “Mfundiza, tokujuwa gweye kofundiza na kulonga ukweli, wala hutonga ukulu wa munhu, lakini kofundiza nzila za Imulungu mna ikweli. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Tulongele, vino vinoga kuliha kodi kwa mndewa mkulu wa Lumi hebu havinogile bule?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Lakini Yesu kaujuwa mwaka ubala wao, kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Ndagusileni isente. Vino, kihanga kino na twaga dino va nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Wamwidika, “Va mndewa mkulu wa Lumi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vinoga. Vinhu va mndewa wa Lumi mgweleleni mndewa wa Lumi, na va Imulungu mgweleleni Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Avo, mgameso ga wanhu hawadahile kumgoga kwa mbuli yoyose. Wakanganya ulonzi wake, wanyamala tuulu.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wafile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Abaho Masadukayo, wanhu olonga kamba kuduhu kuzilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. Wayagwe wamcholela Yesu, wamulongela, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“Mfundiza, Musa katwandikila, ‘Munhu yahafa na kuleka mwehe wake bila wana, ndugu yake munhu ayo kolondigwa yamsole imgane, yamulelele ndugu yake yafile wana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Kukala na ndugu saba. Ija imkulu kasola mwehe, lakini kafa bila kulela wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Wa kabili kamsola mtwanzi ija, lakini nayo kafa bila wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Abaho wa kadatu kamsola. Vivo ilawilile kwa wose saba wamsola, lakini wafa bila wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Kukimambukizo, mtwanzi ija nayo kafa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Lelo mwiisiku ya kuzilibuka, mtwanzi ayo kokuwa mwehe wa nani? Kwavija kakala yasoligwe na wose saba.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu kawedika, “Wanhu wa mwiisi ino osola na kusoligwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>lakini waja wasaguligwe kuzilibuka kulawa kwa wafile na kuupata ugima onda wize, hawasola hebu kusoligwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Oigala na wasenga wa kuulanga, na hondawafe bule. Wao ni wana wa Imulungu kwavija wazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Lakini kwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wanhu wafile, hata Musa kalagusa avo mna imbuli ya ikisolo kikwaka baho kamkema Mndewa, ‘Imulungu wa Abulahamu na Imulungu wa Isaka na Imulungu wa Yakobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Heyo ni Imulungu wa wanhu wagima, siyo wa wanhu wafile. Kwavija kumwake heyo wose wagima.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe walonga, “Mfundiza, kulonga goya!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Avo hawadahile kumuuza mbuli ziyagwe.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Kilisito Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino habali wanhu olonga kamba Kilisito Mkombola kolawa mulukolo lwa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Kwavija Daudi mwenyego kolonga mna ikitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Kala hano mwambu wangu wa mkono wa kudila,<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>mbaka niwahume wanhu wakwihile na niweke</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:43">hasi mmagulu gako.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Daudi mwenyego kamkema, ‘Mndewa.’ Yodahika vilihi Kilisito Mkombola yalawe mulukolo lwa Daudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowazuma wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Wanhu wose viwakalile omtegeleza, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Muiteganye na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Wao onogelwa kwanga kuno wavala mikanzu mitali, na kulamusigwa na wanhu mna gamagulilo na kukala mna ivigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na mna izinyimwilinyimwili. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Owonela wagane kwa kusola vinhu vao, na kuitenda wanoga kwa kumpula Imulungu kwa kulonga mbuli nyingi! Awo nhaguso yao yobanza ng'hani!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya mgane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maluko 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesu kenula meso gake kawona matajili viwogela nhunza zao mkigelo cha kulavila nhunza. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Abaho kamona mgane mkiwa imoja kagela sente mbili ndodo. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela ukweli, mgane ino kalava kinhu kikulu kubanza wose. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Kwavija matajili walava vija visigale muutajili wao, lakini mgane ino hamoja na ukiwa wake, kalava vose viyotamanila muugima wake.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kubanangigwa kwa Ng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Wanahina wayagwe wakala olonga mbuli ya Ng'anda ya Imulungu, viizengigwe kwa mabwe ganogile na sadaka za wanhu zilavigwe kwa Imulungu. Lakini Yesu kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Mogona gano gose! Siku yokwiza kuduhu dibwe donda disigale uchanha ya diyagwe, mabwe gose gobomoligwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Wamuuza, “Mfundiza, vinhu avo volawilila lini? Choni chondakitendeke kulagusa kipindi cha kulawilila vinhu avo cha mmabehi?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu kawedika, “Muiteganye, munhu sikuyawavizile. Kwavija wanhu wengi okwiza kwa twaga jangu, na kulonga, ‘Niye ayo Kilisito!’ na ‘Kipindi cha mmabehi!’ Lakini sikumuwakweleleze. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Mwahahulika ng'hondo na zumozumo, sikumudumbe, kwavija vinhu avo volondigwa tanhu vilawilile, lakini kimambukizo king'hali hakinavika.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Wanhu wa isi imoja oitowa na wanhu wa isi iyagwe, undewa umoja oitowa na undewa uyagwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kila hanhu hokuwa na migudemo mikulu ya isi, lufilili lwa nzala na mitamu, volawilila vinhu va kugela bwembwe na vilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Lakini gang'hali haganalawila gano gose, mogogigwa na kudununzigwa. Mogaligwa mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na kuwagodeka mkifungo, mogaligwa haulongozi wa wandewa na wakulu wa isi mbuli ya twaga jangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Kino chokuwa kipindi chenu kinogile cha kuwapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Gangamaleni, sikumunyawenyawe mbuli ya vija vonda mwidike, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>kwavija niye nowagwaa ubala na mbuli za kulonga. Kuduhu munhu mna iwanhu wamwihileni yodaha kuwahuma hebu kulema chonda mulonge. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Mohindukigwa na tata zenu na mama zenu na ndugu zenu na wanhu wa mulukolo, na mbwiga zenu, na wayagwe vimwili owakoma. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Wanhu wose owehila mweye mbuli ya twaga jangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Lakini kuduhu hata luvili lumoja lwa mmapala genu londa lupotele. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Mwahagangamala, moihonya wenyego.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kubanangigwa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maluko 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Mwahajona buga da Yelusalemu dizungulukigwa na wakalizi, baho mujuwe kipindi cha kubanangigwa cha mmabehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Baho, waja weli Yudea wakimbilile kuvigongo, waja weli kudibuga walawanye, waja weli kumigunda sikuwabwele kudibuga. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Kwavija kino acho kipindi cha nhaguso kutenda gaja gandikigwe galawilile. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Mna izisiku azo ogaya watwanzi weli na zinda na waja okong'heza! Kwavija hokuwa na magayo ng'hani mwiisi, na ng'hasiliki ya Imulungu yokuwa mna iwanhu wano. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Wayagwe okomigwa kwa panga, na wayagwe osoligwa na kugodekigwa mziisi zose, na wanhu haweli Wayahudi odihondahonda buga da Yelusalemu, mbaka kipindi chao vonda kimale.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Hokuwa na vilaguso mna dizuwa, mna imbalamwezi, na mna zinhondo. Isi zose zokuwa mna ukugaya, odumba mvumo wa bahali na ng'humbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Wanhu osinduka kwa bwembwe, kwa kubetela chondakilawilile mwiisi, kwavija vinhu vili kuulanga votigisika. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Kipindi acho omona Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza, mna gamawingu kwa nguvu ng'hulu na ukulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Avo vinhu vino vahasonga kulawilila, mwime na mwinule mapala genu uchanha, kwavija kukomboligwa kwenu kwa mmabehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da biki da mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela lusimo luno, “Geseni biki da mtini na mibiki yose iyagwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Mwahagona majani gake gosonga kuzuka, mojuwa kamba vuli da mmabehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Vivija, mwahavona vinhu avo volawilila, mujuwe kamba Undewa wa Imulungu wammabehi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>“Nowalongeleni ukweli, wanhu wa lukolo luno hawafa wose mbaka gano gose galawilile. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Ulanga na isi vobita, lakini mbuli zangu hondazibite.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaleni meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Iteganyeni! Mizoyo yenu sikuigogigwe na unovu wa mwiisi ino, kukoligwa, na kugaya mbuli ya ugima uno, kwavija siku ayo yowasinhusa <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>kamba mtego. Kwavija yowezila wanhu wose okala kila hanhu mwiisi. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Muiteganye na mupule siku zose, ili mudahe kuhonyeka mna zimbuli zose zino zondazilawilile na kwima haulongozi wa Mwana wa Munhu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Kila siku Yesu kakala kofundiza Mng'anda ya Imulungu, na yahavika ichungulo, kacholaga kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni na kakala kuko kilo kigima. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Imitootondo ng'hani wanhu wose wakala ochola kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu kumtegeleza.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Kiseto cha kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Kipindi cha Nyimwilinyimwili ya Magate hagageligwe Hamila, kikemigwe Pasaka kikala behi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala ozahila nzila ya kumkoma Yesu, lakini wawadumba wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotogola kumuhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Mwenembago kamkumba Yuda Isikaliote, imoja wa wanahina longo na wabili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Yuda kachola kwa wakulu wa walava nhosa na wakulu wa wakalizi wa Ng'anda ya Imulungu, kawalongela vija vonda yamuhinduke Yesu kumwao. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Nao wadeng'helela na waitogolela kumgwaa sente. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yuda katogola, na kasonga kuzahila nzila ya kumgela Yesu mmakono gao kwa kinyelegezi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koitanda kuja ndiya ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Siku ya Magate hagageligwe Hamila ivika. Siku ayo bofu da ng'hondolo da Pasaka dolavigwa nhosa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Avo Yesu kawatuma Petulo na Yohana, kawalongela, “Choleni mkatutandile ndiya ya Pasaka tuje.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Nao wamuuza, “Kolonda tukakutandile kwahi indiya ya Pasaka?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mwahengila kudibuga, mnzila momting'hana mbigalo yapapile nongo ya mazi. Mkwelelezeni mbaka mng'anda yonda yengile, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>na mulongeleni mwenekae, ‘Mfundiza kokuuza, dakwahi gati dondanidile ndiya ya Pasaka niye na wanahina zangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Nayo kowalagusila gati kulu da uchanha dihambigwe, mumo mtutandile kila kinhu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Wasegela wavika kila kinhu kamba vija Yesu viyawalongele, nao watanda ndiya ya Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiya ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Saa viivikile, Yesu kakala hana indiya na watumigwa zake. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Kawalongela, “Nisulukila ng'hani kuja ndiya ino ya Pasaka hamoja na mweye ning'hali sinadununzika! <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Avo nowalongela, honda nije kabili mbaka vonda ilawilile Muundewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Abaho Yesu kasola kikasi cha divai, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kalonga, “Soleni kino mung'wile mose. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Nowalongela kulawa sambi, honda ning'we divai ino mbaka vonda wize Undewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Abaho kasola gate, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kadibanzula, kawagwaa, kalonga, “Uno ulo lukuli lwangu, ulavigwe mbuli ya mweye. Tendeni vino kwa kung'humbuka niye.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Vivija, viwamambukize kuja indiya ya ichungulo, kawagwaa kikasi, kalonga, “Kino acho kikasi cha lagano da sambi dilagusigwa kwa damu yangu, ikwitika mbuli ya mweye.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“Lakini, loleni! Munhu yonihinduka kabahano na niye hana indiya! <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Mwana wa Munhu kofa kamba Imulungu viyalondile, lakini kogaya munhu ija yomuhinduka!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Abaho wasonga kuiuza, nani viweli yonda yatende vivo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuibamilila mbuli ya ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Wanahina wakala oibamilila wao kwa wao nani yokoneka munhu mkulu kubanza wose. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Wandewa wa wanhu haweli Wayahudi wana udahi kwa wanhu, vilongozi oikema, ‘Mbwiga wa wanhu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Lakini kumwenu mweye haili vivo bule, munhu mkulu kumwenu yawe kamba munhu mdodo, na kilongozi yawe kamba msang'hanaji. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Vino, nani yeli munhu mkulu, ija yakalile mmeza koja, hebu ija yotanda indiya? Ona, ayo ija yakalile mmeza koja. Lakini niye na hagati yenu kamba munhu yosang'hana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Mweye mukala na niye kipindi chose cha kugezigwa kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>kamba Tatangu viyanigwelele Undewa na niye nowagwaa Undewa awo. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Moja na kung'wa mmeza yangu mna Undewa wangu, na mokala mna ivigoda va Undewa kugatawala makabila longo na mabili ga Izilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula kamba Petulo kombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Yesu kalonga, “Simoni, Simoni! Tegeleza! Mwenembago kampula Imulungu kuwageza mweye, kuwabagula wanogile na wehile, kamba vija mfolaji viyobagula fuya na hemba. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Lakini nikupulila kwa Imulungu gweye Simoni, ili kumtamanila kwako Imulungu sikukupotele. Na vondaunibwelele, uwagangamize ndugu zako.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Petulo kamwidika, “Mndewa, notogola kugodekigwa na gweye mkifungo na kufa!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesu kalonga, “Petulo, nokulongela ukweli, kilo cha lelo nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika, konibela miyanza midatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kipindi cha kugaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Abaho Yesu kawauza wanahina zake, “Vino, kipindi kija viniwatumile kuno mduhu kibindo hebu mkoba hebu vilatu, muhungukiligwa na kinhu chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Wamwidika, “Aka, hatuhungukiligwe na kinhu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Lakini sambi, munhu yoyose yeli na kibindo, hebu mkoba yausole, na munhu yoyose yelibule panga yakachuuze koti jake yakagule. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Kwavija nowalongela Maandiko Gang'alile galongile, ‘Kekigwa mdibumbila dimoja na wabananzi,’ golondigwa gavikizwe. Nowalongela, gaja gandikigwe mbuli ya niye golawilila.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Wanahina walonga, “Mndewa, lola, hano hana mapanga mabili!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Nayo kawedika, “Yotosha!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kompula Imulungu kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesu kasegela kudibuga dija kachola kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni, kamba viyazowele, na wanahina zake wamkweleleza. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Viyavikile kuko, kawalongela, “Mpuleni Imulungu, sikumwingile mna ukugezigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Abaho kawaleka, kachola utali wa kwasa dibwe, kafugama, kampula Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>Kalonga, “Tata, wahalonda, unisegesele kikasi kino cha madununzo. Siyo kamba vinilonda niye, lakini kamba viulonda gweye.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Msenga wa kuulanga kamulawilila, kamgangamiza. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Kwa usungu mkulu uyakalile nao kampula ng'hani, mbaka fuguti dimulawa, fuguti jake dikala kamba madwendwe ga damu golagala hasi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Viyamambukize kumpula Imulungu, kabwela kwa wanahina zake, kawavika okuluza kwavija wakala wadonhile mbuli ya kunyunyuwala. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Kawalongela, “Habali mowasa? Lamukeni mumpule Imulungu, sikumwingile mna ukugezigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali kolonga, lunhu lwa wanhu luvika lulongozigwe na Yuda, imoja wa wanahina zake longo na wabili. Yuda kamcholela Yesu kamulamusa kwa kumnonela. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Lakini Yesu kamulongela, “Yuda, komuhinduka Mwana wa Munhu kwa kumnonela?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Wanahina wakalile hamoja na Yesu viwonile gaja gonda galawilile, wauza, “Mndewa, tuwakanhe na mapanga getu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Imoja wao kambiga kwa panga msang'hanaji wa Mkulu wa walava nhosa na kamkanha digwiti da mkono wa kudila.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Lakini Yesu kalonga, “Bule sikumutende avo!” Kadikwasa digwiti da munhu ija, kamuhonya.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wakulu wa walava nhosa na wakulu wa wakalizi wa Ng'anda ya Imulungu na wavele wezile kumgoga, “Habali, mwiza kungoga kwa mapanga na malungu, kamba nambavi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Siku zose ng'hala na mweye Mng'anda ya Imulungu hamngogile bule. Lakini kino acho kipindi chenu cha kusang'hana, muundewa wa ziza.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayo 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maluko 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Baho wamgoga Yesu, wengila nayo mng'anda ya mkulu wa walava nhosa. Petulo kamkweleleza kwa kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Wabwinha moto hagati hana uluwa, wakala hamoja na Petulo kakala hamoja nao. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Msang'hanaji imoja wa kitwanzi viyamone Petulo kakala aho haumoto, kamulola bunhuu, kalonga, “Vivija munhu ino kakala hamoja na Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Lakini Petulo kabela, kalonga, “Gwee, mtwanzi gwe, simjuwile bule!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Hamwande kidogo munhu iyagwe kamona Petulo, kalonga, “Vivija na gweye kwa imoja wao!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Lakini Petulo kamwidika, “Gwee munhu gwe, siyo niye!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Vidibitile saa dimoja, munhu iyagwe kagangamiza ng'hani, “Kweli munhu ino kakala hamoja na Yesu, kwavija nayo mwenekae wa Galilaya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Lakini Petulo kamwidika, “Munhu gweye, sikijuwile kiulonga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Bahaja, viyakalile yang'hali kolonga, nzogolo keka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Mndewa kahinduka, kamulola Petulo, nayo Petulo kakumbuka Mndewa viyamulongele, “Kilo cha lelo nzogolo yang'hali hanakwika, konibela miyanza midatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Petulo kalawa kunze kalila kwa usungu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozehigwa na kutowigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maluko 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Wanhu wakalile omkaliza Yesu, wakala omzeha na kumtowa, <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>viwamgubike gameso wamuuza, “Lagula! Nani yakutowile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Vivija walonga mbuli ziyagwe nyingi za kumuliga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa mkitala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Imitondo yake, wavele, wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa waiting'hana hamoja na Yesu kagaligwa mkitala acho. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Walonga, “Tulongele! Vino, gweye ayo Kilisito Mkombola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu kawedika, “Nahawalongela, honda munitogole bule, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>na nahawauza mbuli, honda mwidike bule. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Lakini kusongela sambi, Mwana wa Munhu kokala muukulu mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa Imulungu yeli na Udahi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Wose walonga, “Vino gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Yesu kawedika, “Vivo vimulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Walonga, “Hatulonda usindila uyagwe! Siye wenyego tumuhulika viyalongile!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Abaho wanhu wose wenuka, wamgala Yesu kwa Pilato, <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>wasonga kumulavila vitala, walonga, “Tumvika munhu ino kowagiza wanhu zetu, kowagomesa wanhu sikuwalihe kodi kwa mndewa mkulu wa Lumi na koikema heyo ayo Kilisito Mkombola na koikema Mndewa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilato kamuuza, “Gweye ayo Mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu kamwidika, “Vivo viulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Abaho Pilato kawalongela wakulu wa walava nhosa na ulunhu lwa wanhu, “Siyonile mbuli ya kumtagusa munhu ino.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Lakini wao wagangamiza ng'hani, walonga, “Kwa mafundizo gake kowading'hula wanhu wose wa mwiisi ya Yudea. Kasongela Galilaya na sambi keza hano.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilato viyahulike avo kauza, “Vino munhu ino mwenekae wa Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Viyajuwile kamba Yesu kalawa mwiisi ilongozigwa na Helode, kamgala kwa Helode, yakalile Yelusalemu kipindi acho. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Helode viyamone Yesu kadeng'helela ng'hani, kwavija kahulika mbuli zake na toka mwaka kakala yolonda kumona. Kakala kobetela kona unzonza utendigwa na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Avo Helode kamuuza Yesu mbuli nyingi, lakini hamwidike mbuli. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa walawilila kuulongozi wamulavila vitala Yesu vikulu vikulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Helode na wakalizi zake wamzeha Yesu na kumbezeli, abaho wamvaza kiwalo cha undewa wambweza kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Kipindi kikija Helode na Pilato wakala mbwiga, kwavija ako umwaka wakala waihile.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotagusigwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilato kawakema hamoja wakulu wa walava nhosa, vilongozi na wanhu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>kawalongela, “Mumgala munhu ino kumwangu mulonga kakala kowagiza wanhu. Lelo nimuuza mgameso genu na siyonile mbuli yoyose ihile yumumtagusile. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Vivija Helode hachonile kiyabanange, lekaavo kambweza kumwetu. Kwavija kuduhu mbuli yoyose yaitendile munhu ino imtende yakomigwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Avo nolagiza yatoigwe mbalati na kumuleka yachole.”<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Chahavikaga kipindi cha Nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka, Pilato kalondigwa yamfungulile mfungwa imoja. <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Lunhu lose lukemelela, “Mkome munhu ayo! Tufungulile Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Balaba kakala yagodekigwe mkifungo mbuli ya kuwading'hula wanhu kudibuga, na mbuli ya ukomaji.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilato kalonda kumulekesa Yesu, avo kalulongela ulunhu kabili. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Lakini wagendelela kukemelela, “Muwambe mumsalaba! Muwambe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilato kawalongela mwanza wa kadatu, “Vino, mbuli gani ihile yaitendile munhu ino? Siyonile mbuli yoyose yaitendile munhu ino imtende yakomigwe! Nolagiza yatoigwe mbalati na kumulekesa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Wagendelela kukemelela ng'hani, olonga Yesu yawambigwe mumsalaba, kukimambukizo nyangi zao zihuma. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Avo Pilato katogola kija kiwalondile kumtendela Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Kamfungulila munhu iwamulondile, ija yagodekigwe mbuli ya kuwading'hula wanhu na ukomaji, na kamgela Yesu mmakono gao wamtendele kamba viwalondile.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Wakalizi wamulongoza Yesu, viwakalile omgala, wamting'hana munhu imoja kulawa Kilene, twaga jake Simoni, kakala kolawa kumgunda, wamgoga wamdikwa umsalaba, na wamulagiza yaupape hachugu ha Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza, mmwanza awo wakala watwanzi wayagwe wakalile omulilila na kuiyalala. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesu kahinduka kawalongela, “Mweye kina mama wa Yelusalemu! Sikumunililile niye, lakini ililileni wenyego na wanenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Kwavija kipindi chokwiza wanhu olonga, ‘Wamweda watwanzi hawalelile wana na hawakong'heze!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Kipindi acho wanhu ovilongela vigongo, ‘Tulagalile!’ na ovilongela visugulu, ‘Tufiseni!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>kwavija kamba wanhu otenda mbuli zino kipindi biki ding'hali bisi, vino yokuwaze kipindi biki dahanyala?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Wanhu wabili wayagwe wakalile wabananzi, wagaligwa wakomigwe hamoja na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Viwavikile hanhu hakemigwe, “Fumvu da Pala,” wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, hamoja na waja wabananzi wabili, imoja mwambu wa mkono wake wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wa mkono wake wa kumoso. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu kalonga, “Tata, gela kumgongo nzambi zao, kwavija hawakijuwa kiwotenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Waigolela viwalo vake kwa kubwanha simbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Wanhu wema aho olola, kuno wakulu wa Wayahudi omzeha Yesu, walonga, “Kawakombola wayagwe, leka yaikombole mwenyego, kamba heyo ayo Kilisito, yasaguligwe na Imulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Vivija wakalizi wamzeha, wamcholela wamgwaa divai ya ugwadu, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>kuno olonga, “Kamba gweye kwa Mndewa wa Wayahudi, ikombole mwenyego!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Uchanha ya msalaba wake wandika vino, “Ino ayo Mndewa wa Wayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Imoja wa waja wabananzi yawambigwe mumsalaba, kamuliga Yesu, kalonga, “Vino gweye siyo Kilisito Mkombola? Ikombole mwenyego na siye!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Lakini ija iyagwe kamkomhokela miyage, kalonga, “Vino, gweye humdumba Imulungu bule? Na gweye kutagusigwa kamba heyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Gweye na niye totagusigwa goya, kwavija tobokela fungu da sang'hano zetu, lakini munhu ino hatendile mbuli yoyose ihile.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Abaho munhu ija kamulongela Yesu, “Yesu, ung'humbuke wahengila Muundewa wako!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nokulongela ukweli, lelo kokuwa na niye Paladiso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Ikala saa sita imisi, ziza diigubika isi yose mbaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>kwavija zuwa dileka kumwemwesa. Panziya da Ng'anda ya Imulungu digola gati da Ng'anda ya Imulungu na hanhu hong'ala ng'hani, didegeka mhande mbili. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesu kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Tata, noika mmakono gako loho yangu!” Viyalongile avo, kafa.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Mkulu wa wakalizi wa Lumi viyagone gago galawilile, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kalonga, “Munhu ino kweli kakala yanogile!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Wanhu wose wakalile waiting'hane aho kulola mbuli azo, viwagone gago galawilile, wabwela ukayao, kuno otowa mhambaga zao kwa kunyunyuwala. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Wanhu wose wamjuwile Yesu na watwanzi wamuwinzile kulawa Galilaya, wema kwa kutali olola mbuli azo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozikigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Kukala na munhu imoja twaga jake Yusufu, munhu wa Mkitala, kakala munhu yanogile na kutenda goyolonda Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Keza kulawa Yudea buga da Alimataya na kakala kobeta kwiza kwa Undewa wa Imulungu. Hamoja kakala imoja wa wakulu wa mkitala, hagatogole gaja gawalondile wayage na gaja gawakalile otenda. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Kachola kwa Pilato, kampula lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Abaho kaluhumulusa hasi ulukuli, kaluzingiliza sitili, kalwika mdipanga disongoligwe mdibwe, dikalile hadinazikiligwa munhu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Ikala ijumaa, siku ayo ikala siku ya kuitanda siku ya Kubwihila ikalile behi kusonga.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Watwanzi waja wamkweleleze Yesu kulawa Galilaya wachola na Yusufu, na wajona dipanga na vija vilwikigwe lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Abaho wabwela ukae, watanda mavuta gonung'hila goya walubake lukuli lwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Mna isiku ya Kubwihila wabwihila kamba Malagizo ga Musa vigalagize.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Jumapili imitootondo ng'hani, watwanzi waja wachola kudipanga, kuno wasola mavuta gonung'hila goya gawatandile. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Wadivika idibwe dibimbilisigwa hamgwazo wa umulomo wa dipanga,<figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Dibwe dibimbilisigwe hamgwazo ya dipanga</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>avo wengila mdipanga, lakini hawaluwone lukuli lwa Mndewa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Wema aho kuno oikanganya mbuli ayo, bahaja wanhu wabili wavalile viwalo vizelu chuwee wema behi nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Kuno wamema bwembwe, watwanzi waja waidulika hasi, wanhu waja wawalongela, “Habali momzahila munhu yeli mgima mna iwanhu wafile? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Hano kahaduhu, kazilibuka. Kumbukeni vija viyawalongele viyakalile Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Mwana wa Munhu kolondigwa yageligwe mmakono ga wanhu otenda nzambi, awo omuwamba mumsalaba, na siku ya kadatu kozilibuka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Baho watwanzi waja wazikumbuka mbuli zake, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Walawa mdipanga, na wawalongela wanahina longo na imoja mbuli zose zino na wanhu wayagwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Watwanzi awo wakala, Malia Magidalena, Yoana na Malia mamake Yakobo, awo hamoja na watwanzi wayagwe wawalongela watumigwa mbuli azo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Lakini watumigwa wagesa kamba mbuli zilongigwe na iwatwanzi waja za ubozi, na hawawatogolele bule. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Lakini Petulo kenuka na kakimbila mbaka kudipanga, kasungulila mgati, kayona sitili iiyeka. Abaho kabwela ukae kuno kokanganya kija kilawilile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa kuchola Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maluko 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Siku didija wanahina wabili wa Yesu wakala ochola kuna ikijiji kimoja kikemigwe Emau, kikala utali wa kilometa longo na imoja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilometa longo na imoja sawa na maili saba</char></note> kulawa Yelusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>wakala osimulila usheha wa mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Viwakalile osimulila, Yesu mwenyego kakwesa behi kailongoza nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Wamona, lakini wafisigwa sikuwamjuwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mosimulila usheha gani kuno mogenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Nao wema wanyamala tuluu, na vihanga vao vigela bazi kwa kunyunyuwala. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Imoja wao yakemigwe Kileopa, kamuuza, “Vino, gweye wiiyeka ayo huli mwenekae wa Yelusalemu hujuwile mbuli zilawilile kuko sambi sambi?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Kawauza, “Mbuli gani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Nao wamwidika, “Mbuli zimulawilile Yesu wa Nazaleti, munhu ayo kakala mtula ndagu wa Imulungu na kakala yokoneka mgameso ga Imulungu na wanhu wose kamba kana udahi kwa kila kinhu kiyalongile na kiyatendile. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na vilongozi zetu wamgela mmakono yatagusigwe kufa, na yawambigwe mumsalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Na siye tutamanila kamba heyo ayo yonda yawakombole wanhu wa Izilaeli! Lakini lelo siku ya kadatu toka zilawilile mbuli zino. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Watwanzi wayagwe wa mdibumbila jetu watukanganya, imitootondo wachola kuna dipanga, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>lakini hawaluvikile lukuli lwake. Wabwela walonga wawona wasenga wa kuulanga wawalongela kamba, Yesu mgima. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Abaho wanhu wayagwe wa mkibumbila chetu wachola kuna dipanga na wavika vivija viwawalongele watwanzi awo, lakini hawamonile bule.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mwa wabozi, na mizoyo yenu midala kutogola gose galongigwe na watula ndagu wa Imulungu! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Vino, halondigwa Kilisito Mkombola yadununzike kamba avo, abaho yengile muukulu wake?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Yesu kawasimulila gaja galongigwe na Maandiko Gang'alile mbuli yake mwenyego, kusongela mna ivitabu va Musa na maandiko ga watula ndagu wose wa Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Viwavikile behi na ikijiji kiwakalile ochola, Yesu kaitenda kamba kogendelela na mwanza, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>lakini wamgoma ng'hani, olonga, “Ukale na siye, zuwa dihonga na ziza dokwingila.” Avo kagenda na kukala nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Kakala hasi na kuja nao, kasola gate, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, abaho kadibanzula kawagwaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Bahaja, meso gao gagubuligwa na wamjuwa, lakini kapotela mgameso gao. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Wailongela, “Vino, mizoyo yetu hayakile na kimuhemuhe vitukalile mnzila kotulongela na kotusimulila Maandiko Gang'alile?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Bahaja wenuka wabweleganya Yelusalemu, kuko wawavika wanahina longo na imoja wakala hamoja na wanhu wayagwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>olonga, “Mndewa kazilibuka kweli! Kamulawilila Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Wanhu waja wawasimulila kija kiwalawilile mnzila, na vija viwamjuwile Yesu viyadibanzule gate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang'hano 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Wanhu waja viwakalile wang'hali owasimulila mbuli azo, bahaja Yesu kema hagati yao, kawalongela, “Zihozeni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Wasinhuka na kudumba wagesa okona mzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Lakini Yesu kawalongela, “Habali modumba na kunyawanyawa? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Loleni makono gangu na magulu gangu, na mojuwa kamba ayo niye. Mbabaseni mojuwa, kwavija mzimu wabule lukuli na mizege, kamba vimnyona niye.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Viyalongile avo, kawalagusila makono gake na magulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Wakala wang'hali hawatogola, kwavija wakala odeng'helela na kukanganya, avo Yesu kawauza, “Mna kinhu chochose chakuja hano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Wamgwaa kihande cha somba yakokigwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>kakisola, kakija mgameso gao.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Abaho kawalongela, “Mbuli zino azo ziniwalongeleni ving'halile hamoja na mweye, kamba gose gandikigwe mbuli ya niye mna Gamalagizo ga Musa, na gandikigwe na watula ndagu wa Imulungu, na Zabuli galondigwa galawilile.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Baho kazigubula nzewele zao wadahe kugajuwa Maandiko Gang'alile. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Kawalongela, “Vino avo yandikigwe, Kilisito Mkombola kolondigwa yadununzike na siku da kadatu kozilibuka kulawa kwa wafile, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>kwa twaga jake, usenga opetigwa kwa wanhu wa isi zose, kusongela Yelusalemu, ili waleke nzambi zao na Imulungu yazigele kumgongo. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Na mweye awo wasindila wa mbuli azo. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Na niye nowagalila ija iyalongile Tatangu. Lakini beteni kudibuga mbaka nguvu vonda iwezileni kulawa uchanha.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maluko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sang'hano 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Abaho kawalongoza kunze kudibuga mbaka Betania, ako kenula makono gake, kawatambikila. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Viyakalile kowatambikila, kawaleka kagaligwa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Wamtambikila na wabwela Yelusalemu kwa deng'ho kulu, <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>kipindi chose wakala Mng'anda ya Imulungu na kumgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
